<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">JOHWANI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa naJohwani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johwani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naJOHWANI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Vhangeri ridonyohwa naJohwani riri pakati pomabhuku manai yanotsanangura upenyu hwaJesu Khirisitu yari muChibvumirano Chitsva. Mabhuku yakareya yese yanoitiwa “Vhangeri” zvinoreva kuti “Nyaya Dzidonaka.” Nyaya Dzidonaka dzakaredzi dzidonyohwa naMateo, Mariko, Ruka naJohwani, mumasure moipfa nokumuka kwaJesu. Vhangeri raJohwani rinenge ridonyohwa noNhumwa Johwani mumasure momakore makumi mapfemba (90) yokuzvahwa kwaJesu Khirisitu. Kunyange zvazvene bhuku raJohwani risingatsanangure kuti Johwani ndiye adorinyora, asi manyorehwo yarene yadofanana notsamba dzaadonyora iye Johwani, dzinova, 1 Johwani, 2 Johwani uye 3 Johwani. Vanyori vokare vanoti Johwani adonyora bhuku rakareri ari muguta roEfeso maanga achigara.</para>
  <para style="ip">Johwani anoisa pachenu chinangwa chokunyora bhuku rache achiti, adonyorera kuti vanhu vatende kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari mupenyu, Johwani 20:31. Pakutenda zvakarezvi tinova noupenyu muzita rache. Bhuku rakareri ridonyorehwa vaverengi vese, vochiJudha novaye voyamwe marudzi. Vhangeri ridonyohwa naJohwani rino kusiyana kukuru kwaridoita noyamwe mavhangeri matatu. Bhuku rakareri rinonyanyitsa kunyaira pamusoro pozvishamiso zvidoitiwa naJesu richisiya zvomifananidzo yaadopasa pakudzidzisa kwache. Zvimwe zvidoitika zvinokosha, fanike zvokuombekewa kwaJesu nokuedzewa kwache ari musango hazvinai kunyohwa muVhangeri raJohwani.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="ip">Johwani anothanga vhangeri yache kubva pachitsauko (Johwani 1:1-18).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kubvawo pakarepa anodzonyora pamusoro pozvishamiso zvidowanda zvidoitiwa naJesu. (Johwani 1:19—12:50).</para>
  <para style="io1">Paanondopedza zvakarezvi, anodzotsanangura zvinhu zvizinji zvidoitika muupenyu hwaJesu zvidodzotungamira kuipfa futi nokudzomuka kwache kubva kuipfa (Johwani 13:1—20:31).</para>
  <para style="io1">Johwani paanopedzisa vhangeri yache pachitsauko 21 anonyaira zvonguwa yokuzvinangidza kwaJesu kuvanhu mumasure mokumuka kwache kubva kuvadopfa, anodzopedzisira nokunyaira chinangwa chaadonyorera bhuku rakareri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Shoko Ridova Nyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Pakuthanga kwanga kuno Shoko, Shoko ranga rina Mwari, futi Shoko ranga riri Mwari. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Wanga ari pakuthanga naMwari. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Zvinhu zvese zvidoitiwa kuburikidza naye, futi kunze kwache hapanai chokugadzihwa changa chidogadzihwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Maari maiva noupenyu, futi upenyu hwacho hwaiva chiedza chovanhu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Chiedza chinovhenekera murima, asi rima harinai kuchikunda.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Kwanga kuno munhu adotumiwa naMwari, waiitiwa Johwani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Adouira kuti apfakazire chiedza chakarecho, kuti vese vatende kuburikidza naye. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Iye wanga asiri chiedza chacho, asi adouya kuti apase upfakazi hwochiedza. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Chiedza chochokwadi chinovhenekera vanhu vese changa chichiuya panyika.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Wanga ari panyika, futi nyika idonhadzihwa kuburikidza naiye, asi nyika yacho hainai kumuziva. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Adouya kuvanhu vache, asi vanhu vachevo havanai kumutambira. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Asi vese vadomutambira, vaye vadotenda muzita rache, adovapasa simba rokuva vana vaMwari, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />vasinai kuzvahwa nomagazi kana nokuda kwomuviri wonyama, kana nokuda kwomunhu, asi vadozvahwa naMwari.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Shoko ridodzova munhu ndokugara pakati pedu, rizere nonyasha nochokwadi, tidoona kubhwinya kwache, kudoita kunge kwoMwanakomana mubodzi adobva kuna Baba.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Johwani adopasa upfakazi pamusoro pache ndokudaidzira achiti, “Wakareyu ndiye wandidoreva ndichiti, ‘Anouya mumasure mangu asi adondithangira, nokuti wanga aripo inini ndisati ndavapo.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Nokuti pakuzara kwache, tese tidotambira mutsa pamusoro pomutsa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Nokuti mutemo udouya kuburikidza naMozisi, asi mutsa nochokwadi zvidouya naJesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Hapanai adomboona Mwari, asi Mwanakomana mubodzi ari pachipfuwa chaBaba ndiye adoita kuti azikane.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upfakazi hwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Ruka 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Uhwu ndihwo upfakazi hwaJohwani, padouya nhume dzovaJudha kwaari dzichibva kuJerusarema, dzaiva vaphirisita novarevhi, vadomubvunza vachiti, “Ndiwe yani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Adopasa upfakazi, haanai kuramba, asi adopasa upfakazi achiti, “Ndiniba Khirisitu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ivo vadomubvunza vachiti, “Chii manje? Ndiwe Eriya chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Iye adoti, “Ndiniba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Vadomuti, “Ndiwe muporofiti chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Iye adopindura achiti, “Neye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Vadodzoti kwaari, “Ndiwe yani? Tinoda mhinduro yokopasawo vadotituma. Unozviti ndiwe yani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />adoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Ndini ‘izvi roanokuwa musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">yororai nzira yaIshe!’” Ndokunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa nomuporofiti Isaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Zvino vaimubvunzavo vanga vatumiwa kubva kuvaFarise. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Manje kana usiri Khirisitu, kana Eriya, kana kuti muporofiti, sei uri kuombeka?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Johwani adovapindura achiti, “Ndinoombeka nomvura, asi pakati penyu padomira umwe wamusingazive, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />wakareyo anouya mumasure mangu, ndinokodzeraba kusugudura murawu woshangu dzache.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Zvakarezvi zvidoitika muBhetani kumhiri kwohwizi Jorodhani, kwaanga achiombekera Johwani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwayana raMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Mangwanachimuka Johwani adoona Jesu achiuya kwaari ndokubva wati, “Nangarai Hwayana raMwari, rinobvisa zvitema zvonyika! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Iyeyu ndiye wandidoreva ndichiti, ‘Mumasure mangu muchauya umwe adondithangira, nokuti wanga aripo kumberi kwangu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Inipano handinai kuziva kuti ngupi, nondava yakareyo ndidouya ndichiombeka nomvura, kuti iye anangidziwe kuvaIzirairi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Johwani adopasa upfakazi achiti, “Ndidoona Mweya achiburuka kubva kudenga adoita kunge njiva, ndokuvhoda nokuramba ari paari. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Inini pachangu ndaimuzivaba, asi adondituma kuti ndiombeke nomvura, ndiye adoti kwandiri, ‘Waunoona achivhodewa naMweya achigara paari, wakareyo ndiye anoombeka naMweya Mutsvene.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Inini ndidoona ndokupasa upfakazi kuti, wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana waMwari.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadzidzi vaJesu Vokuthanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Mangwanachimuka Johwani wanga adomira novadzidzi vache vairi, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />ndokunangara Jesu waitekaira zvache, Johwani adobva wati, “Onai Hwayana raMwari!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vadzidzi vairi vadomunzva achitaura zvakarezvo, vadobva vatevera Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Jesu adocheuka, ndokuvaona vachimutevera, iye ndokuti kwavari, “Anga muri kutsvaga chii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Vadoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi” zvinoreva kuti Mudzidzisi, “Muri kugara poi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Adoti kwavari, “Uyai muone.” Vadouya ndokuona paanga achigara, ndokugara naye zuva rakarero, ndava nguwa yanga yaakusvika paawa yochigumi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Umwe wovairi vadonzva Johwani achitaura, achibva watevera Jesu, ndiAndireya, waiva mukoma nomunin'ina naSimoni Pita. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Chinhu chaadothanga kuita kuwana Simoni hama yache, adomunyepa achiti, “Tawana Mesiya,” zvinoreva kuti Khirisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Adoenda naye kuna Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jesu adomunangara ndokubva wati, “Saka ndiweka Simoni, mwanakomana waJohwani? Uchaitiwa Kefasi.” Izvozvo zvinoreva kuti Pita.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Firipi naNatanieri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Zuva ridotevera Jesu adosarudza kuenda kuGaririya. Adowana Firipi ndokumuti, “Nditevere.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Zvino Firipi waibva kuBhetisaidha, guta raibva Andireya naPita. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Firipi adowana Natanieri ndokuti kwaari, “Tamuwana adonyohwa naMozisi pamusoro pache mumurairo, novaporofiti, Jesu woNazareta Mwanakomana waJosefa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanieri adobva wati kwaari, “Pano chinhu chidonaka chingabvewo kuNazareta chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Firipi adobva wamuti, “Uya uone.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Jesu paadoona Natanieri achiuya kwaari adomuti, “Nangarai muIzirairi wochokwadi, asinai unyengeri!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanieri adoti kwaari, “Ko munondiziva tini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Ndakuona usati wadaidziwa naFiripi, pawanga uri pasi pomukuyu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanieri adoti, “Mudzidzisi, muri Mwanakomana waMwari! Muri Mambo wovaIzirairi!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jesu adobva wamupindura achiti, “Watenda ndava ndati kwauri ndakuona pasi pomukuyu? Uchaona zvidokuritsa kukunda zvakarezvi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Zvino adoti kwaari, “Ndinokuudzai chokwadi, muchaona denga richizuruka, ngirozi dzaMwari dzichikwira nokuburuka pamusoro poMwanakomana woMunhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Muchato kuKana romuGaririya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Pazuva rochitatu kudoitika muchato kuKana romuGaririya. Amai vaJesu vanga variko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />futi Jesu novadzidzi vache vanga vakokewawo kumuchato wakareyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Waini paidopera, amai vaJesu vadomunyepa vachiti, “Havachinai waini.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwavari, “Nai amai, munoda kuti ndiitei nazvo? Nguwa yangu hainati yasvika.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Amai vache vadobva vanyairira vashandi vachiti, “Itai zvese zvaanokunyepai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Zvino pakarepo panga padogadzikiwa makhate yomabhwe matanhatu, nochikonzero chotsika yokuzvinatsa kwovaJudha. Gate ribodzi raipinda marita yangasvike zana. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jesu adoti kuvashandi, “Zazai makhate yakareya nomvura.” Vashandi vadobva vayazaza kuti punumunu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Adodzoti kwavari, “Chitekai muende kopasa mukuru womutambo.” Ivo vadobva vaita zvakarezvo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mukuru womutambo paadoraidza mvura yanga yava waini. Adozivaba kwayanga yabva asi vashandi, vanga vateka mvura ndivo vaiziva. Mukuru womutambo adodaidza murume waichata <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ndokuti kwaari, “Munhu wese anothanga kukovera waini idonaka, kana vaphunga vakorewa, wodzovapasa waini yomaruhwi. Asi iwewe wanga udondochengeta waini idonaka kusvika manje!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Chakarechi nyhiratidzo chokuthanga, chidoitiwa naJesu paKana roGaririya. Paadonangidza kubhwinya kwache vadzidzi vache vadotenda kwaari.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi, Jesu adoenda kuKaperenaume namaache, novanin'ina vache, novadzidzi vache vadogara kunzvimbo yakareyo mazuva mashoma.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anopinda muimba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mateo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mariko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Ruka 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Phasika mutambo wovaJudha pawanga waakusvika, Jesu adoenda kuJerusarema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Adowana muimba yaMwari munovanhu vaitengesa mombe, mahwai, hangaiva novaiita basa rokusandura mari vadogara pamatafura yavo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Adobva watora thambo achibva wagadzira siwepu nayo, ndokuvabiritsa muimba yaMwari vese nomombe nomahwai, achibva wataya mari yovaichinjana, achiphidigura mathafura yavo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Adonyairira vaitengesa hangaiva achiti, “Biritsai zvinhu zvakarezvi, rekai kuita imba yaBaba vangu musika wokutengeserana.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vadzidzi vache vadoyeuka kuti zvidonyohwa kuti, “Shungu dzoimba yenyu dzichandipedza.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />VaJudha vadodzoti kwaari, “Unochiratidzo chipi chaungatinangidze kuti unochikuriri chokuita zvakarezvi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Pwanyai imba yaMwari yakarei, ndinoivakha futi pamazuva matatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />VaJudha vadobva vati, “Kudopera makore makumi manai nomatanhatu imba yaMwari yakarei ichivakhiwa, manje iwepa ungaivakhe chere pamazuva matatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Asi iye imba yaMwari yaaireva wanga uri muviri wache. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Paadodzomutsiwa kuvadopfa, vadzidzi vache vadoyeuka kuti wanga wanyaira zvakarezvo, vadobva vatenda magwaro noshoko ridonyaihwa naJesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoziva Unhu hwoVanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Zvino paanga ari muJerusarema pamutambo woPhasika, vazinji vadotenda muzita rache pavadoona zviratidzo zvaadoita. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Asi Jesu haanai kuzvipereka kwavari nokuti waiziva unhu hwovanhu vese. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Saka haanai kuda kuti umwe munhu amupase upfakazi pamusoro pomubiyake.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu naNikodhimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kwanga kuno murume muFarisi waiitiwa Nikodhimo, waiva mukuru wovaJudha. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Murume wakareyo adouya kuna Jesu usiku ndokumuti, “Mudzidzisi, tinoziva kuti muri mudzidzisi anobva kuna Mwari, ndava hapanai munhu angaite zviratidzo zvamunoita, kusara kwokunge achitova naMwari.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Ndinokunyepa chokwadi, munhu haangaone umambo hwaMwari kusiya kwokunge watozvariwa pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodhimo adoti kwaari, “Munhu angazvariwe tini kana wakura? Angapinde pakare chere mumimba mamaache kuti azvariwe?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jesu adopindura achiti, “Ndinokunyepa chokwadi, kunze kwokunge munhu wazvahwa nomvura noMweya, anopindaba muumambo hwaMwari. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Icho chidozvahwa nomunhu munhu, nochidozvahwa noMweya mweya. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Reka kushamisiwa ndava ndakuti, unofanira kuzvahwa pakamu. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mhepo inopupuza ichienda kwainoda, unondonzva ruzha rayene, asi unozivaba kwainobva nokwainoenda. Zvakarezvo ndozvidoita wese adozvahwa noMweya.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodhimo adomubvunza achiti, “Izvozvi zvinoitika tini?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Uri mudzidzisi wovaIzirairi, saka unonzvitsitsaba zvakarezvi nai? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Chokwadi, ndinoti kwauri, tinonyaira zvatinoziva nokupa upfakazi hwozvatidoona, asi imipa hamutambire upfakazi hwedu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Kana ndidokunyairira zvopasi pano imipa motadza kuzvitenda, mungadzotenda tini ndikakunyairira zvokudenga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Hapanai adokwira kudenga kunze kwaiye Mwanakomana woMunhu adoburuka achibva kudenga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Futi sezvidoitiwa naMozisi zvokuturika nyoka musango, naiyewo Mwanakomana woMunhu anofanira kuturikiwa pamusoro, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kuti wese anotenda kwaari ave noupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Nokuti Mwari adoditsa nyika zvokutoipasa Mwanakomana wache mubodziyo, kuti wese anotenda kwaari areke kupfa, asi ave noupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nokuti Mwari haanai kutuma Mwanakomana wache kuti apase murandu nyika, asi kutoti nyika iponesewe kuburikidza naye.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Uyo anotenda kwaari haatongewe. Asi asingatende watotongewa kare, nokuti haanai kutenda kuMwanakomana waMwari mubodzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Kutongewa nghuku, kuti chiedza chidouya panyika, asi vanhu vadofarira rima pachinzvimbo chochiedza, nokuti zviito zvavo zvanga zvidoipa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ndava wese anoita zvidoipa anovenga chiedza, futi haauye pachiedza, kuti zviito zvache zvireke kufumuhwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Asi uyo anoita zvochokwadi anouya pachiedza, kuti zvioneke pachenu kuti zviito zvache zvidoitiwa muna Mwari.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi Jesu adoenda kunyika yoJudhiya novadzidzi vache. Adoramba anavo kwakareko achiombeka vanhu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />NaJohwaniwo wanga achiombeka ari paAnoni panyasi noSarimu, nokuti pakarepo panga panomvura idowanditsa, futi vanhu vadouya vachiombekewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Nokuti Johwani wanga asati waisiwa mutorongo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Manje nharo dzidomuka pakati povadzidzi vaJohwani noumwe muJudha, pamusoro pokuzvinatsa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Vadouya kuna Johwani ndokuti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, uyeuye wamanga munaye kumhiri kwohwizi Jorodhani, wakareuye wamudopfakazira uye, waakuombeka, futi vanhu vese vaakutoenda kwaari.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Johwani adovapindura achiti, “Hapanai angawane chaangatambire kunze kwokunge wachipasiwa kubva kudenga. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Imipa munotondipupurira kuti ndidoti, ‘Ndiniba Khirisitu, asi ndidotumiwa pamberi pache.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Uyo anomwenga ndiye murume, muperekedzi womurume, anomira achinzva, anofara chaizvo achinzva dzinga romurume, saka mufaro wanguyu wapfachukira. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Anofanira kuingidzika, asi inini ndinofanira kuderedzeka.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyo Adobva kuDenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Uyo anobva kumusoro ari pamusoro povese, uyo ari pasi ndowopasi, anonyaira zvinhu zvopasi futi, uyo anobva kudenga ari pamusoro povese. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Anopasa upfakazi hwozvinhu zvaadoona nozvaadonzva, asi hapanai anotambira zvaanopfakaza. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Uyo anotambira upfakazi hwache anoisa chisimbiso chache chokuti, Mwari ngwochokwadi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Nokuti iyeyo adotumiwa naMwari anonyaira mazvi yaMwari, nokuti adopasiwa Mweya asingapimihwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Baba vanopfarira Mwanakomana, futi vadoisa mumaoko yache zvinhu zvese. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Uyo anotenda kuMwanakomana anoupenyu husingapere, uyo asingatetekere Mwanakomana haazoona upenyu, asi ukari hwaMwari huchagara pamusoro pache.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jesu noMukadzi wokuSamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Zvino Jesu paadoziva kuti vaFarisi vanga vanzva kuti iye wanga achiita nokuwombeka vadzidzi vadowanda kukunda Johwani, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />kunyange Jesu pachake wanga asingawombeke, asi vadzidzi vache basi. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Zvino adosiya Judhiya ndokuenda pakare kuGaririya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Asi waifanira kupinda nomuSamariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nokudaro adosvika muguta rinoitiwa Saika riri muSamariya, panyasi pomunda Jakobho waadopasa senhaka kumwanakomana wache Josefa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Pakarepo panga panosime raJakobho. Jesu waneta nohwendo hwache, adogarikika panyasi posime. Yanga yakutova masikati makuru. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ipopo mukadzi muSamariya adouya koteka mvura. Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ndipasewo mvura yokumwa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Nokuti panguwa yakareyo vadzidzi vache vanga vaenda muguta kotenga zvokuja. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mukadzi muSamariya adoti kwaari, “Waita tini naiwe! Uri muJudha, inini ndiri mukadzi muSamariya. Unondikumbira tini mvura yokumwa?” (Nokuti vaJudha havajidzane novaSamariya). <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Dai waiziva chipo chaMwari, futi kuti mbani ari kuti kwauri, ‘Ndipasewo chokumwa,’ waitomukumbira, iye wokupasa mvura inopasa upenyu peno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mukadzi adoti kwaari, “Changamire, hamunai mukombe wokutekesa, apa sime ridonoka kuti gwiri. Munoitora poi mvurayo inopasa upenyu? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Muri mukuru chere kuna baba vedu Jakobho, vadotipasa sime rakareri, nokumwa pakarepa ivo novanakomana vavo nozvipfuwo zvavo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Wese anomwa mvura yakarei anonzva nyota pakamu, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />asi wese anomwa mvura yandichamupasa anodzonzvaba nyota pakare. Mvura yandichamupasa ichava maari chithubu chinobirika mvura inothubukira kuupenyu husingapere.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mukadzi adoti kwaari, “Changamire, ndipaseiwo mvura yakareyo, kuti ndirege kunzva nyota, nokudzouya pano koteka mvura.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Enda kodaidza murume wako, muuye pano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mukadzi adomupindura achiti, “Handinai murume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jesu adobva wamuti, “Wakohorora pawati, ‘Handinai murume.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ndava udoita varume vashano, nomurume waunaye ngwakoba, ipopa wanyaira chokwadi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mukadzi adoti kwaari, “Changamire, ndiri kuona kuti muri muporofiti. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Madzibaba yedu vainamatira pagomo rakareri, manje imipa munoti vanhu mbavanamatire muJerusarema.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Amai imi, nditendei kuti nguwa iri kuuya, yamusingadzonamata Baba muri pagomo rakareri kana muJerusarema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Munonamata zvamusingazive, isisu tinonamata zvatinoziva, nokuti ruponiso runobva kuvaJudha. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Asi nguwa inouya, naipopa yatosvika, yokuti vanamati vochokwadi vachanamata Baba mumweya nomuchokwadi, ndava Baba vanotsvaga vadodaro kudzovanamata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mwari ndiMweya, vanomunamata vanofanira kunamata muMweya nomuchokwadi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mukadzi adoti kwaari, “Ndinoziva kuti Mesiya ari kuuya, iye anoitiwa Khirisitu, kana wauya achatitsanangurira zvinhu zvese.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Inipano ndiri kutaura naiwewe ndini wacho.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Pakarepo vadzidzi vache vadobva vasvika. Vadoshamisika kuti wanga achinyaira nomunhikadzi, asi hapanai adoti kumukadzi, “Anga chii chauri kuda?” Kana kuti kuna Jesu, “Muri kunyairireiko naye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Mukadzi adobva wasiya mukhate wache womvura ndokuenda muguta achiti kuvanhu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Uyai, muone munhu wandinyepa zvese zvandidoita. Angaveba Khirisitu nai wakareyu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Vadobirika muguta ndokuenda kwanga kuna Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Nguwa yakareyo vadzidzi vanga vachimukumbira vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, ijai.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Asi adoti kwavari, “Ndinochikafu chokuja chamusingazive.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Saka vadzidzi vadotaurirana vachiti, “Kuti pangave nowamuvigira zvokuja?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chikafu changu ndiko kuita zvinodiwa naiye adondituma, nokupedzisa basa rache. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Handiti munoti, ‘Kwasara mwedzi minai kuti kukohwa kusvike?’ Ndinokunyepai kuti, nangarai muone minda yaibva yaakuda kukohwewa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Zvino uyo anokohwa anotambira mubairo, achiunganidza muchero woupenyu husingapere, kuti mujari nomukohwi vafare pabodzi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Pakarepa tsumo inoti, ‘Umwe adojara, umwe ndokukohwa,’ inobva yava chokwadi. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ndidokutumai kokohwa pamusinai kushanda, vamwe vadoshanda, imimi mukakohwa kubva padukuta ravo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vanhu vazinji vomuSamariya vadobva muguta iroro raiitiwa Saika vadotenda kwaari nopamusaka pochapupu chomukadzi wakareyo chaadoti, “Wandiudza zvese zvandidoita.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Zvokuti vanhu vomuSamariya pavadosvika kuna Jesu, vadomukumbira kuti agare navo. Iye adodzogara ipopo mazuva mairi.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Novamwe vazinji vadotenda nondava yoshoko raJesu pachake. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Vadoti kumukadzi, “Hatichatenda nondava yomashoko yako, nokuti tazvinzvira tega, futi taakuziva kuti, chokwadi uyu ndiye Muponisi wonyika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorapa Mwanakomana woMutungamiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Mazuva mairi payadopera adosumuka ndokuenda kuGaririya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Nokuti Jesu pachake adopupura achiti, “Muporofiti anokudziwaba munyika yache.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Saka paadosvika muGaririya, vanhu vomuGaririya vadomutambira, nokuti vadoona zvaadoita muJerusarema kumutambo woPhasika kwavanga vaendawo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Saka adoenda pakare paKana roGaririya, paadosandura mvura kuiita waini. Zvino kuKaperenaume kwanga kuno mutungamiri waiva nomwanakomana waihwara. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Paadonzva kuti Jesu wanga wauya kuGaririya achibva kuJudhiya adoenda komuteterera kuti asvike kuKaperenaume korapa mwanakomana wache, nokuti wanga wakutopfa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Jesu adobva wati, “Munotendaba kusiya kwokunge maona zviratidzo nozvishamiso.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mutungamiri adobva wati kwaari, “Changamire, uyai mwanakomana wangu asati wapfa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Enda, mwanakomana wako achachira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Murume adotenda shoko raadotaurihwa naJesu ndokubva waenda kumba. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Paanga achienda vashandi vache vadosangana naye ndokumuudza kuti mwanakomana wache wanga wapurumuka.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Saka adovabvunza nguwa mwana yaadothanga kupurumuka, vadomuudza kuti, “Nezuro masikati paawa yochinomwe ndipo padogwata kupisa muiri.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Baba vomwana vadobva vaziva kuti ndiyo nguwa Jesu yaadotaura achiti, “Mwanakomana wako achachira.” Saka iye adotenda pabodzi nomhuri yache yese.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Wakareyu wanga uri munana wochipiri udoitiwa naJesu paadobva kuJudhiya achienda kuGaririya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuporesewa Padziva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo Jesu adoenda kumutambo wovaJudha, waiva kuJerusarema. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Zvino muJerusarema panyasi posuwo rikuru rohwai pano dziva ridotenzewa muchiHebheru kuti Bhetezidha, raiva notumathumba tushano tudoripoteredza. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Makaremo ndimo maienzerera chaunga chozvirema zvidowanditsazvo, marombe, mhetamakumbo, novadotonhora nhengo. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ndava panoimwe nguwa ngirozi yaiburukira mudziva ichibvundura mvura, saka wese waithanga kupinda mudziva kana mvura yabvunduriwa, waiporesewa chihwere chese chaanenge anacho. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Umwe murume waiva pakarepo, wanga wahwara kwomakore makumi matatu nomasere. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Jesu paadomuona achiziva kuti wanga adoenzera pakarepo nguwa idorepha maninge, adoti kwaari, “Unoda kuporesewa chere?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Muhwere adopindura achiti, “Changamire, hapanai anondiwisira mudziva kana mvura yabvunduriwa, pandinenge ndichiri kuenda umwe anobva wandithangira kupinda.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Sumuka, tora bonde rako, utekaire.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Kabodzi nokabodzi murume adobva wapora. Adotora bonde rache ndokutekaira. Manje zuva rakarero ranga riri Sabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />MaJudha vadobva vati kumurume wanga waporesewa, “Nasi iSabata, haubvumihwe kutakura bonde rako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Asi iye adovapindura achiti, “Munhu wandiporesa ndiye wanditi, ‘tora bonde rako utekaire.’”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Mbani munhu wacho wakuudza kuti, utore bonde rako utekaire?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Manje murume adoporesewa waizivaba adomuporesa, ndava Jesu wanga waporika muvanhu panzvimbo yakareyo, pachaunga chovanhu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo, Jesu adowana murume uye ari muimba yaMwari ndokubva wamuti, “Onaka waporesewa, reka kuita zvitadzo pakare kuti zvidoipitsitsa zvireke kuuya kwauri.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Murume uye adobva waenda konyepa vaJudha kuti ndiJesu wamuporesa. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Izvozvi ndizvo zvidoita kuti vaJudha vatambudze Jesu, ndava waiita zvakarezvi paSabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Asi Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Baba vangu vachiri kushanda, nainini ndiri kushanda.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Izvozvo ndizvo zvidoitisa kuti vaJudha vatsvagitsitse mabairo yavangamuite, ndava haanai kundochora mutemo woSabata chete, asi waidaidza Mwari kuti ndiBaba vache, kutozvienzanisa naMwari.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simba roMwanakomana roChikuriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ndinokunyepai chokwadi, Mwanakomana hapanai chaangaite ari wega, asi zvaanoona Baba vachiita basi, nokuti zvese zvinoitiwa naBaba zvakarezvo ndizvo zvinoitiwawo noMwanakomana. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Nokuti Baba vanofarira Mwanakomana, vanomunangidza zvese zvavanoita ivo, vachamunangidza mabasa makuru kukunda yakareya, zvokutoti muchashamisika. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Sezvinoita Baba kumutsa vadopfa vachivapasa upenyu, naiyewo Mwanakomana anopasa upenyu munhu waanoda. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Baba hapanai wavanotonga, asi vadopasa kutonga kwese kuMwanakomana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kuti vese varemekedze Mwanakomana, sekuremekedza kwavanoita Baba. Asingaremekedze Mwanakomana haaremekedzewo Baba vadomutuma.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ndinokunyairirai zvochokwadi, uyo anonzva Shoko rangu achitenda kuna iyeyo adondituma, anoupenyu husingapere, haauye pakutongewa, asi wabirika muipfa wapinda muupenyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ndinokunyepai chokwadi ndichiti, nguwa iri kuuya, izvozvi yatosvika, apo vadopfa vachanzva dzinga roMwanakomana waMwari, futi vacharinzvavo vachararama. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Baba sezvavanoupenyu mavari, saizvozvo vadopasawo Mwanakomana kuti ave noupenyu maari. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Futi vadomupasa simba rochikuriri kuti atonge, ndava Mwanakomana woMunhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Rekai kushamisiwa nozvakarezvi, nokuti nguwa iri kuuya apo vese vari mumanda vachanzva dzinga rache <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />vobirika, avo vadoita zvidonaka vomukira kuupenyu, avo vadoita zvidoipa vomukira kutongewa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanopfakazira Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Hapanai chandinokona nosimba rangu ndega, ndinotonga sezvandinonzva, kutonga kwangu kudokohoroka, ndava ndinotsvagaba zvangu ndega asi zvinodiwa noadondituma. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Kana ndikazvipupurira, upfakazi hwangu hunenge huri hwomabhwodo, <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Aripo umwe anoupfakazi pamusoro pangu, futi ndinoziva kuti anondiitira upfakazi hwochokwadi. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Pamudotuma vanhu kuna Johwani, iye adopasa upfakazi hwochokwadi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Zvinorevaba kuti ndinotambira upfakazi hunobva kuvanhu, asi ndinonyaira zvakarezvi kuti muponesewe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Johwani wanga ari mwenje waipfuta uchipasa chiedza, naimipa mudoda nokufarira chiedza chache kwokanguwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Asi upfakazi hwandinahwo mbukuru kukunda hwaJohwani, nokuti basa randidopasiwa naBaba kuti ndipedzise, rakarero randiri kuita, rinondipfakazira kuti Baba vadondituma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Baba pachavo vadondituma vadondipupurira. Dzinga ravo hamunai nokundorinzva kwese, chimiro chavo hamunai nokundochiona kwese, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />nokuti imipa hamunai shoko ravo rinogara mamuri, nokuti hamutende wavadotuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Munonzvera magwaro nondava yokuti munofunga kuti mayari muno upenyu husingapere, magwaro yakareyo ndiyo yanopfakaza pamusoro pangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Asi imipa munoramba kuuya kwandiri kuti muve noupenyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Handitambire kukudziwa kunobva kuvanhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Asi ndinokuzivai kuti hamunai rudo raMwari mukati menyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ndidouya muzita raBaba vangu, asi hamunditambire, kana umwewo akauya muzita rache, iyeyo muchamutambira. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mungatende sei, iyemi munotambira kurumbidzana asi musingatsvage kurumbidziwa kunobva kuna Mwari chete? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Rekai kufunga kuti ndichazokunenedzerai pamberi paBaba. Mozisi wamunovimba naye ndiye anokupasai mhosva. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Dai mudotenda Mozisi, maitendawo inini, nokuti Mozisi adonyora pamusoro pangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Asi kana musingatende zvaadonyora, mungatende tini mashoko yangu?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoposha Zviuru Zvishano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Ruka 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi Jesu adoenda kumhiri kwogungwa roGaririya raidaidziwawo kuti Taibheriyasi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Manje vanhu vadowanditsavo vadomutevera nondava yokuti vadoona zviratidzo zvaadoita pano vaye vanga vanomatenda. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Jesu adokwira pagomo, ndokugarikika novadzidzi vache. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ipopo Phasika, unova mutambo wovaJudha yanga yaakusvika. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Paadonangara ndokuona gurusvusvu raiuya kwaari, ndokuti kuna Firipi, “Tichatenga poi mazingwa kuti vanhu ivova vaje?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Adonyaira zvakarezvo kuti amuedze, nokuti Jesu pachake waiziva zvaanga achidzoita. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Firipi adomupindura achiti, “Muhoro womwedzi mitanhatu unokwanaba kutenga mazingwa yanoita kuti munhu wese awane kachimepfu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Umwe mudzidzi wache, Andireya anova mukoma nomunin'ina naSimoni Pita adoti kwaari, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Panomukomana pano ano mazingwa yobhaari mashano nohove dziiri, asi izvozvi zvingave chii pavanhu vadowanditsa zvidodai?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Itai kuti vanhu vagarikike pasi.” Zvino panzvimbo yakareyo panga panousva huzinji, vanhurume vadogarikika pakarepo vaitosvika zviuru zvishano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Jesu adodzotora mazingwa, ndokuita munamato wokukomborera, adodzoyakovanisa vanhu vanga vadogarikika, ndokuita zvakarezvo nohove, achivapasa zvidoenderana nozvavaida. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Pavadoja vachiguta, adoudza vadzidzi vache achiti, “Unganidzai zvimepfu zvasara kuti pareke kuva nochinotaiwa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Saka vadodzozviunganidza ndokuzaza tsvanda gumi nodziiri dzozvimepfu zvidosiiwa novadoja kubva pamazingwa mashano yobhaari.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vanhu pavadoona chiratidzo chaadoita, vadoti, “Chokwadi uyu muporofiti waidzouya munyika!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Jesu paadoziva kuti vanga vaakutouya komutora nochisimba kuti vamusukumidze kuita mambo, Jesu adobirika pakare kuti ave wega kugomo.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotekaira Pamusoro Pomvura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mariko 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Pakwanga kwadoka vadzidzi vache vadoenda kugungwa, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />vadopinda mukamwadiya ndokuthanga kuyambukira kuKaperenaume. Kwanga kwatodoka, Jesu asati wadzoka kwavari. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Masaisai yogungwa yadosumuka nokuti duthu ridosimba ranga richivhuvhuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Pavanga vafambisa kamwadiya makhiromita yanenge mashano kana matanhatu, vadoona Jesu achitekaira pamusoro pomvura mugungwa achitonyedza kukamwadiya. Vadocha, <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />asi iye adoti kwavari, “Ndini, rekai kucha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Saka vadoda kumutora kuti apinde mukamwadiya, ipopo kamwadiya kadobva kasvika panyika kwavaienda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanhu Vanotsvaga Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Mangwana yacho vanhu vadosara kumhiri kwogungwa vadoziva kuti kwanga kwandova nokamwadiya kabodzi, futi Jesu wanga asinai kupinda mukamwadiya novadzidzi vache, asi kuti vadzidzi vache vadoenda vega. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Zvisinei, tumwadiya tudobva kuTaibheriyasi tudonyedza panzvimbo yavadojira mazingwa musure mokunamata kudoitiwa naJesu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Saka vanhu pavadoona kuti Jesu kana vadzidzi vache vanga vasiri pakarepo, ivo pachavo vadopinda mutumwadiya ndokuenda kuKaperenaume vachimutsvaga.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ndiye Zingwa Roupenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Pavadomuwana kuimwe kumhiri yogungwa, vadomuti, “Mudzidzisi, mauya riniko kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, munonditsvaga isiri ndava yokuti mudoona zviratidzo, asi nondava yokuti mudoja mazingwa muchiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Rekai kushandira kuti muwane zvokuja zvinoparara, asi zvokuja zvinogara kusvikira kuupenyu husingapere. Ndizvo zvamunopasiwa noMwanakomana woMunhu nokuti paari Mwari Baba vadoisa chisimbiso.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Zvino vadoti kwaari, “Tingaitei kuti tiite mabasa yanodiwa naMwari?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Basa raMwari ndorokuti mutende uyo waadotuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Saka vadoti kwaari, “Nyhipi chiratidzo chaunoita, kuti tione tikutende? Ibasa ripi rauchaita? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Madzibaba yedu vadoja mana musango, sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa, ‘Adovapasa zingwa ridobva kudenga kuti vaje.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi ndinokunyepai, ndiMozisiba adokupasai zingwa ridobva kudenga, asi Baba vangu vanokupasai zingwa rochokwadi kubva kudenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ndava zingwa raMwari ndiro rinouya kubva kudenga, ropasa upenyu kunyika.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Vadoti kwaari, “Ishe, tipasei zingwa rakareri nguwa dzese.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ndini zingwa roupenyu, uyo anouya kwandiri anodzonzvaba nzara, noanotenda kwandiri anodzonzvaba nyota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Asi sekukuudzai kwandidoita, mudondiona asi nanasi hamusati manditenda. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Vese vandinopasiwa naBaba vachauya kwandiri, nouyo anouya kwandiri ndinomutairaba kunze. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ndava ndidoburuka kudenga, aikona kudzoita zvandinoda, asi kuda kwaiye adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Kwakareku ndiko kuda kwoadondituma, kuti ndireke kurasikihwa kana nomubodzi panovese vaadondipasa, asi kudzozvimutsa pazuva rokupedzisira. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Nokuti uku ndiko kuda kwaBaba wangu, kuti wese anonangara Mwanakomana nokutenda kwaari anofanira kuva noupenyu husingapere, futi ndichamumutsa nozuva rokupedzisira.” <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Zvino vaJudha vadon'un'uzika ndava wanga wati, “Ndini zingwa ridoburuka kubva kudenga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vadobva vati, “NdiJesuba uyu mwanakomana waJosefa, anababa namai vatinoziva? Sei waakuti, ‘Ndidobva kudenga?’” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Rekai kun'un'uzika pakati penyu megamega. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Hapanai angakone kuuya kwandiri kunze kwokutoti Baba vadondituma vamukwezvera kwandiri, futi ndichamumutsa pazuva rokupedzisira. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Zvidonyohwa mumabhuku yovaporofiti kuti, ‘Futi vese vachafundisiwa naMwari.’ Wese adonzva achidzidza kubva kuna Baba anouya kwandiri. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Hapanai adoona Baba kusiya kwouyo basi adobva kuna Mwari, ndiye adoona Baba. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, uyo anotenda anoupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ndini zingwa roupenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Madzibaba yenyu yadoja mana musango, asi vadopfa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Iri ndiro zingwa ridoburuka kubva kudenga, kuti munhu arije areke kupfa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ndini zingwa ripuma ridoburuka kubva kudenga, wese zvache anoja zingwa rakareri, anochira nokusingapere, futi zingwa randichapasa, kuitira kuti nyika iwane upenyu ndiwo muviri wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />VaJudha vadozvipikisa pakati pavo, vachiti, “Ko murume wakareyu angatipase sei muviri wache kuti tije?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Saka Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi ndinokunyepai kuti, kusiya kwokuti matoja muviri woMwanakomana woMunhu nokumwa gazi rache, hamunai upenyu mamuri, <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />uyo anoja muviri wangu nokumwa gazi rangu ano upenyu husingapere, futi ndichamumutsa nozuva rokupedzisira, <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />nokuti muviri wangu chikafu chaicho, pakare gazi rangu nyhokumwa chaicho. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Uyo anoja muviri wangu nokumwa gazi rangu anogara mandiri, nainini maari. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Fanike Baba vapenyu vadondituma, inini ndinorarama nokuda kwaBaba, saka uyo anondija achararama nokuda kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Iri ndiro zingwa ridouya kubva kudenga, risinai kufanana noridojiwa nomadzibaba vadodzopfa, uyo anoja zingwa rakareri anochira nokusingapere.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Izvozvi adozvinyairira musinagoge, paanga achidzidzisa kuKaperenaume.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shoko Roupenyu Husingapere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Vadzidzi vache vazinji pavadozvinzva, vadoti, “Kunyaira kwakareku kudooma, mbani angakutambire?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Asi Jesu paadoziva mukati mache kuti vadzidzi vache vadonyunyuta nozvakarezvi, adoti kwavari, “Ko magumbuhwa nozvakarezvi nai? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ko kana mukadzoona Mwanakomana woMumhu achikwira kuenda kwanga ari kare? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mweya ndiye anopasa upenyu, nyama inobatsiraba chinhu, mashoko yandidonyaira kwamuri, ndiyo mweya noupenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Asi pano vamwe venyu vasingatende.” Nokuti Jesu waiziva kubva pakuthanga kuti mbapi vasinai kutenda, futi kuti mbani waidzomupandukira. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Adodzoti pakare, “Ndosaka ndakunyepai kuti hapanai angauye kwandiri kusiya kwokunge wazvigonesewa naBaba vangu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo vadzidzi vache vazinji vadoita chinepfu ndokurega kumutevera. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Jesu adoti kuno vanogumi novairi, “Naimipa munoda kuendawo chere?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Pita adomupindura, “Ishe, tingaende kunani? Ndimi munomazvi youpenyu husingapere. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Futi tidotenda, ndokuziva kuti ndimi Mutsvene waMwari.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jesu adovapindura, “Handinai kukusarudzai imipa gumi novairi? Manje mumwe wenyu ndijabhurosi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Adotaura achireva Judhasi mwanakomana waSimoni Sikariyoti, ndava wanga ari umwe wovanogumi novairi, waidzomupandukira.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Novanin'ina Vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo Jesu adopoterera nomuGaririya, waifamba fambaba muJudhiya nokuti maJudha vaitsvaga kumubaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Zvino mutambo wovaJudha woMatumba wanga waakusvika. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Saka vanin'ina vache vadoti kwaari, “Birika pano uende kuJudhiya kuti vadzidzi vako vaone mabasa yauri kuita. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Nokuti hapanai munhu anoshanda kabisira iye achida kuti azikane. Kana uchiita zvinhu zvakarezvi, zvinangidze kunyika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Nokuti naivo vanin'ina vache vanga vasingamutendewo.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Nguwa yangu hainati yasvika, asi kwamuri chero nguwa idokodzera. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vanhu vomunyika havagone kukuzondai, asi vanozonda inini ndava ndinopasa upfakazi hwokuti mabasa yavo yadonyangara. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Endai kumutambo imimi, inipano ndiri kuendaba kumutambo wakareyu, ndava nguwa yangu inokodzera hainati yasvika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Mumasure mokunyaira ikoko, adoramba ari muGaririya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamutambo woMatumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Asi mumasure mokuenda kwovanin'ina vache kumutambo, iye adozoendawo, asingazviise pachenu, asi achizvisvisva. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vanga vachimutsvaga pamutambo, vachiti, “Ari poi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Panga pano kunyaira nyaira kwovanhu kudowanda pamusoro pache. Ukuwo vamwe vaiti, “Munhu adonaka,” vamwe vachiti, “Neye, ari kutsambutsa vanhu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Asi nokucha vatungamiri vovaJudha hapanai adonyaira pachena pamusoro pache.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Panenge pakati pomutambo Jesu adoenda muchivanze choimba yamwari ndokudzidzisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />MaJudha vadoshamisika nazvo vachiti, “Seiko munhu wakareyu achiziva maninge, asi iye asinai kupfunda?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Saka Jesu adovapindura, “Dzidziso yangu njanguba, asi njaiye adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Kana munhu upi zvache achida kuita kuda kwaMwari, achaziva kana kudzidzisa kwangu kuchibva kuna Mwari, kana kuti ndiri kundonyaira zvangu ndega. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Uyo anozvinyaira pachake anotsvaga kukudziwa kwache. Asi anotsvaga kukudziwa kwoadomutuma pachokwadi, munowakareyo hamunai mabhwodo. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mozisi adokupasaiba mutemo? Asi hapanai kana mumwe wenyu anouchengeta. Sei muchitsvaga kundibaya?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Vanhu vadopindura vachiti, “Unoshave! Mbani ari kuda kukubaya?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ndidoita chishamiso chibodzi, imipa mese mudoshamisika nacho. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Mozisi adokurairai kuti muchecheudze vanakomana venyu (aikona kuti zvidobva kwaari, asi zvidobva kumadzibaba yenyu), naimipa munochecheudza munhu paSabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Kana munhu achichecheudziwa paSabata, kuti mutemo waMozisi uregedze kuchohwa, maakundikaripira ndava ndaporesa munhu paSabata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Regedzai kutongera tsvete, asi tongai zvidorungama.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko Jesu Ndiye Mesiya Nai?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Vamwe vanhu vokuJerusarema vadodzoti, “Iyeyu ndiyeba nai munhu wavanga vachitsvaga kuti vabaye? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nguyu ari kunyaira pajekerere, futi hapanai chavari kunyaira kwaari! Zvingave izvo chere kuti vakuru vanonatsa kuziva kuti ndiye Khirisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Manje tinoziva kunobva munhu wakareyu, asi panooneka Khirisitu, hapanai anoziva kwaanobva.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Saka Jesu paanga achidzidzisira muchivanze choimba yaMwari adodaidzira achiti, “Munondiziva, futi munoziva kwandinobva. Asi ndidouyaba nokuda kwangu, uyo adondituma ndiye chokwadi. asi munomuzivaba, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />inini ndinomuziva nokuti ndinobva kwaari, futi adondituma.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Saka vadotsvaga kumusunga, asi hapanai adomubata, nokuti nguwa yache yanga isati yakwana. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Zvidodaipo vanhu vadowanda vadotenda kwaari, vadoti, “Kana Khirisitu wacho wauya, achaita zviratidzo zvizinji kukunda zvidoitiwa nomunhu iyeyu chere?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Varindi Vanotumiwa Kosunga Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />VaFarisi vadonzva mhomho yovanhu ichindonyaira nyaira pamusoro paJesu. Saka vatungamiri vovaphirisita novaFarisi vadotuma varindi voimba yaMwari kuti vamusunge. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Zvino Jesu adoti, “Ndichava nemi kanguwa kapfupi, ndobva ndaenda kuno adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Muchanditsvaga asi munondiwanaba, kwandinenge ndiri munokonaba kuuya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vadonyairirana vachiti, “Nghupi kwaari kuda kuenda munhu wakareyu kwatisingadzomuwana? Anoda kuenda koporika muvanhu vedu vari mukati momaguta yomaGiriki kodzidzisa maGiriki chere? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Anorevei kana achiti, ‘Muchanditsvaga asi munondiwanaba,’ uye kuti, ‘Kwandinenge ndiri munokonaba kuuya?’”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuhwizi Tomvura Inopasa Upenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Pazuva rikuru rokupedzisira kwomutambo, Jesu adosimuka ndokudaidzira achiti, “Kana pano anonyota, mbaauye kwandiri amwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Uyo anotenda kwandiri, sezvidotauhwa noGwaro, ‘Mumwoyo mache muchaerera tuhwizi twomvura youpenyu.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Manje zvakarezvi wanga achireva Mweya, waidzotambiriwa novaye vadotenda kwaari, nokuti kupasiwa Mweya kwanga kusati kwaitika, ndava Jesu wanga asati wasimudzihwa pakubhwinya.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kupesana Pakati Povanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Pavadonzva mazvi yakareya, vamwe vavo vadoti, “Chokwadi iyeyu ndiye muporofiti uye wataitarisira.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vamwe vadoti, “Iyeyu ndiye Khirisitu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Asi vamwe vadoti, “Ko Khirisitu angauye achibva kuGaririya chere? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ko Gwaro harina kuti Khirisitu waidzova nzvahwa yaDhavhiti, achibva kuBheterehema, musha waigara Dhavhiti?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Saka padova nokupesana pakati povanhu nondava yache. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vamwe vavo vaida kumusunga, asi hapanai adomubata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusatenda Kwovatungamiri vovaJudha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Varindi voimba yaMwari vadodzoka kuvatungamiri vovaphirisita nokuvaFarisi, ndokubva vavabvunza vachiti, “Sei musina kuuya naye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Varindi voimba yaMwari vadopindura vachiti, “Hapanai munhu adombonyaira kunge munhu wakareyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />VaFarisi vadobva vavapindura vachiti, “Ko naimimiwo matsambutsiwa nai? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Pano umwe pakati povatungamiri kana pakati povaFarisi watenda kwaari chere? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Aiwa! Asi gurusvusvu rakareri, risingazivi mutemo ridoshurikidziwa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodhimo, uyo adomboenda kuna Jesu, uku ari umwe wavo, adoti kwaari, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ko mutemo wedu unopomera mhosva munhu asinati wanzviwa nokuzikana kuti anoitei chere?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Vadopindura vachiti, “Naiwewe unobva kuGaririya chere? Zvitsvage mumaGwaro, uchaona kuti hapanai muporofiti achabva kuGaririya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ipopo munhu wese adobva waenda kumba kwache.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mukadzi Adobatiwa Achihura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Jesu adoenda kugomo roMiorivhi. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Adopinda futi muimba yaMwari mambakwedza, vanhu vese vadouya kwaari, saka adogarikika ndokuvadzidzisa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Vadzidzisi vomutemo novaFarisi vadounza mukadzi wanga awanikidziwa achiita zvobonde, ndokubva vamumisa pakati pavo <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />vadobva vati, “Mudzidzisi, mukadzi iyeyu wawanikidziwa achihura. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Manje pamutemo, Mozisi adotiraira kuti titeme nomatombo mukadzi adodaroyo. Munoti chii naye?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Vadonyaira zvakarezvo kumuedza, kuti vawane mhosva yokumutonga nayo, asi Jesu adokotama ndokuthanga kunyora pasi nokakumo kache. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pavadoramba vachimubvunza, adokotamuka ndokuti kwavari, “Wakareyo asinai chitadzo pakati penyu mbaave wokuthanga kumukhuva nodombo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Adokotama pakare ndokunyora pasi nokakumo kache. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Asi pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vadobirika mubodzi mubodzi, zvichithanga nomukuru wacho, vadosiya Jesu wega nomukadzi adomira pamberi pache. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jesu adokotamuka ndokumubvunza achiti, “Nai amai, vari poi? Hapanai wakunenedzerai mhoka chere?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Adopindura achiti, “Hapanai Ishe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Jesu adobva wati, “Nainini ndinokupaiba mhosva, endai zvenyu, mureke kudzotadza pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Chiedza Chonyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Jesu adotaura kwavari pakare achiti, “Ndini chiedza chonyika, uyo anonditevera anofambaba murima, asi achawana chiedza choupenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />VaFarisi vadobva vati kwaari, “Uri kuzviitira upfakazi, kupupura kwako hakunai chokwadi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jesu adopindura achiti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:14">“Kana dai ndikazviitira upfakazi, upfakazi hwangu ngwochokwadi, ndava ndinoziva kwandidobva nokwandiri kuenda. Asi munozivaba kwandidobva nokwandiri kuenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Imimi munotonga nomutoo wovanhu, inini hapanai wandinotonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Kana zvazvene ndikatonga, kutonga kwangu ndokwochokwadi, ndava handitonge ndega, asi ndinaBaba vadondituma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mumutemo wenyu mudonyohwa kuti upfakazi hwovairi ichokwadi, <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />ndinozvipa upfakazi, futi Baba vadondituma vanopawo upfakazi pamusoro pangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Saka vadoti kwaari, “Vari poi Baba vakovo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Munondizivaba kana naBaba vangu, dai maindiziva maizivawo Baba vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Adonyaira mazvi yakareya ari paiisihwa zvipo, paanga achidzidzisa muimba yaMwari, asi hapanai adomusunga, nokuti nguwa yache yanga isinati yasvika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munokonaba Kuenda Kwandiri Kuenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Pakare Jesu adoti kwavari, “Ndinobirika ndichienda, muchanditsvaga futi muchapfira muzvitadzo zvenyu, kwandiri kuenda munokonaba kuuya.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vadobva vati, “Achazvibaya chere, asi ndicho chikonzero chaanonyairira kuti, ‘Kwandiri kuenda munokonaba kuuya?’” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Adoti kwavari, “Muri vopasi pano, inini handisi wopano, ndinobva kumusoro. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ndakunyepai kuti muchatopfira muzvitadzo zvenyu ndipo. Kusiya kwokunge matenda kuti ndini iye, chokwadi muchapfira muzvitadzo zvenyu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Ndiwe yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ndiri iye wandaikuudzai kubvira pakuthanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ndinozvidowanda zvokutaura pamusoro penyu zvokukutongai, asi adondituma ngwochokwadi, futi zvandidonzva kwaari ndinozvinyaira pachena kuvanhu vonyika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Havanai kunzvitsitsa kuti wainyaira kwavari nozvaBaba vache. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Saka Jesu adoti, “Kana masumudza Mwanakomana woMunhu, pakarepo ndopamuchaziva kuti ndini iye, futi kuti ndinoitaba chinhu mumasimba yangu ndega asi ndinotaura sezvandidodzidzisiwa naBaba. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Adondituma aneni, haanai kundisiya ndega, ndava ndinombondoita zvinomufadza.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Paanga achitaura daipo vazinji vadotenda kwaari.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chokwadi Chichakusunungurai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Jesu adodzoti kuvaJudha vadotenda kwaari, “Kana mukaramba muri mudzidziso yangu, muri vadzidzi vangu zvochokwadi, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />futi muchaziva chokwadi, chokwadi chichakuitai vadosununguka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Vadomupindura vachiti, “Tiri nzvahwa dzaAbhurahamu, futi hapanai adombotiita varanda vache. Unodzotaura tini uchiti, ‘Muchasununguhwa?’” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, wese anoita chitadzo muranda wochitadzo. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Muranda haagari mumba nokusingapere, mwanakomana anopfuurira nokusingapere. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Saka kana Mwanakomana achikusunungurai muchasununguka chaizvo izvo. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndinoziva kuti muri nzvahwa dzaAbhurahamu, asi muri kuda kundibaya, ndava mamuri hamunai nzvimbo yoshoko rangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ndiri kukunyairirai zvandidoona kuna Baba vangu, naimimi munoita zvamudonzva kuna baba venyu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Vadomupindura vachiti, “Abhurahamu ndivo baba vedu.” Jesu adoti kwavari, “Dai manga muri vana vaAbhurahamu maiita zvidoitiwa naAbhurahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Asi manje muri kuda kundibaya, inini munhu adokunyairirai chokwadi chandidonzva kuna Mwari, zvakarezvi ndizvoba zvidoitiwa naAbhurahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Munoita zvidoitiwa nababa venyu.” Vadoti kwaari, “Hatisi vana vouhure, tina Baba mubodzi, iye Mwari.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Dai Mwari waiva Baba venyu, maindida, ndava ndidobva kuna Mwari, handinai kuzviuyira, asi adondituma saka ndiri pano. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Nondava yei musiri kunzvitsitsa zvandinonyaira? Chikonzero nyhokuti munotambiraba kudzidzisa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Muri vababa venyu jabhurosi, futi chido chenyu nyhokuita zvinodiwa nababa venyu. Anga ari mhondi kubvira pakuthanga, futi haanai chokuita nochokwadi, nokuti haanai chokwadi maari. Paanobhwodoka anonyaira zvache chaizvo, ndava ndinyamabhwodo futi ndibaba wayene. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Asi nondava yokuti ndinonyaira chokwadi, hamunditende. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Mbani wenyu angandikomwese kuti ndaita chitadzo? Ndikakunyairirai chokwadi, sei musinganditende? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />WaMwari, anonzva mashoko yaMwari, chikonzero chokureka kunzva kwenyu indava yokuti hamuzi vaMwari.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naAbhurahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vadomupindura vachiti, “Hatisi kunyaira zvidokohoroka chere patiri kuti uri muSamariya futi unoshave?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jesu adopindura kuti, “Handinai shave, asi ndinoremekedza Baba vangu, asi munondizvidza. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Handizvitsvagire kuremekedzewa, asi aripo anotsvaga kuremekedzewa wakareyo ndiyewo mutongi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, wese anochengeta shoko rangu anodzopfaba.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />VaJudha vadoti kwaari, “Manje taakuziva kuti unoshave. Abhurahamu adopfa, kunge zvidoitawo vaporofiti, iwewe waakuti, ‘Wese anochengeta shoko rangu, anopfaba!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Uri mukuru kuna baba vedu Abhurahamu? Ivo vadopfa, novaporofiti vadopfawo! Unozviti ndiwe yani?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Kana ndikazvirumbidza, kuzvirumbidza kwangu hakureve chinhu, Baba vangu vamunoti ndivo Mwari wenyu ndivo vanondirumbidza. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Asi hamunai kumuziva, inini ndinomuziva. Ndikati, handimuzive, ndingavewo womabhwodo kunge imimi, asi ndinomuziva, futi ndinoteerera kudzidzisa kwache. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Baba venyu Abhurahamu vadokondwa kuti vaidzoona zuva rangu, vadoriona ndokupfara.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vadodzoti kwaari, “Hausati wasvika makore makumi mashano, manje udoona Abhurahamu iwewe?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jesu adopindura kuti, “Ndinokuudzai chokwadi, Abhurahamu asati wavapo, Ndiripo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Saka vadohwenga matombo kuti vamuteme nayo, asi Jesu adoverera kubva muimba yaMwari.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Adozvahwa ari Rombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Paanga achitekaira, adoona murume adozvahwa ari rombe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Vadzidzi vache vadomubvunza kuti, “Mudzidzisi, ko mbani adotadza, murume wakareyu kana kuti vabereki vache, zvidoita kuti azvariwe ari rombe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jesu adovapindura kuiti, “Ndizvoba kuti murume iyeyu adotadza, kana kuti mbabereki vache, asi kuti mabasa yaMwari yaoneke maari. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tinofanira kuita mabasa yoadondituma kuchiri kweru daipa, usiku huri kuuya, ipopo hapanai anodzokona kushanda. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ndichiri munyika, ndiri chiedza chonyika.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvo, adosvipira mathe pasi ndokukanya tumatope nayo, achiparanga mumaziso yorombe, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />achiti kwaari, “Enda koshamba mugambwa rinoitiwa Siromi” (zvinoreva kuti kutuma). Saka adoenda ndokushamba, ndokudzoka waakuona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Vavakidzani novadombomuona kare achiri kuita zvokupemha vadoti, “Iyeyu ndiyeba nai munhu waigara achikumbira kare?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vamwe vadoti, “Ndiyeyu,” vamwewo ndokuti, “Neye, vadondofanana.” asi iye waimbondoti, “Ndini.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Vadoramba vachindomubvunza vachiti, “Naiwe, meso yako yadovhurika tini?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Iye adovapindura achiti, “Murume anoitiwa Jesu adokanya tumatope ndokuparanga mumaziso mangu achinditi, ‘Enda kuSiromi koshamba’ saka ndidoenda ndokubva ndaakuona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vadoti kwaari, “Ari poi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Iye adopindura achiti, “Handizive.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">VaFarisi Vanoongorora Kurapiwa Kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Vadoendesa kuvaFarisi murume waiva bofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Zvino raiva zuva roSabata Jesu paadokanya tumatope achimusvinudza. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />VaFarisi vadomubvunza pakare kuti adoona tini. Iye adoti kwavari, “Adoisa tumatope pamaziso yangu, ndokubva ndashamba, ndokubva ndaakuona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Vamwe vovaFarisi vadoti, “Murume wakareyu haabve kuna Mwari, ndava haachengete Sabata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Asi vamwe vadoti, “Ko munhu anenge ari mutadzi angaite tini zviratidzo zvidodai?” Padova nokupesana pakati pavo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Saka vadoti pakare kumunhu wanga ari rombe, “Unoti chii naye, iye wakusvinudza meso daipa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Adoti, “Muporofiti.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha havanai kuzvitenda kuti, wanga ari rombe futi kuti adodzovhuriwa meso, kusvikira vatodaidza vabereki vomurume adovhuriwa meso, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />vadovabvunza vachiti, “Ndiye mwanakomana wenyu, wamunoti adozvahwa ari rombe chere? Manje waakuona tini?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Vabereki vache vadovapindura kuti, “Tinoziva kuti iyeyu mwanakomana wedu, futi kuti adozvariwa riri rombe, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />asi kuti manje waakuona sei hatizivi, futi tinozivaba kuti mbani wasvinudza meso yache. Mubvunzei wayaruka, anozvinyairira wega.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Vabereki vache vadotaura daipo nokuti vaicha vatungamiri vovaJudha, nokuti vatungamiri vovaJudha vanga vatorangana kuti kana ani zvache akaita upfakazi hwokuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu, waidzodzingiwa musinagoge. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Saka vabereki vache vadodzoti, “Wayaruka, mubvunzei.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Saka vadodaidza kochipiri murume wokuzvahwa ari rombe, ndokuti kwaari, “Pasa mbiri Mwari, tinoziva kuti munhu wakareyu mutadzi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Adovapindura achiti, “Kana ari mutadzi, ndinozvizivaba, chinhu chibodzi chandinoziva nyhokuti, ndaiva rombe, manje ndaakuona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Adoita chii kwauri? Adokupenyesa tini?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Adovapindura achiti, “Ndakunyairirai kare, asi munotetekeraba. Munodirei kuzvinzva pakare? Munodawo kuita vadzidzi vache nai?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Manje vadobva vamushora vachiti, “Iwepa ndiwe mudzidzi wache, asi isisu tiri vadzidzi vaMozisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tinoziva kuti Mwari adotaura naMozisi, asi kana ari munhu wakareyu, tinozivaba kwaanobva.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Murume adopindura achiti, “Sei, izvi zvinoshamisa! Hamuzivi kwaanobva, asi iye wasvinudza meso yangu. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tinoziva kuti Mwari haatetekeri vatadzi, asi kana ari anocha Mwari, achiita zvinomufadza, Mwari anomutetekera. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Hazvinai kumbonzvika kubva pakuthanga kwonyika kuti panoadovhura meso yomunhu adozvahwa ari rombe. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Dai munhu wakareyu asinai kubva kuna Mwari, waikonaba kuita chinhu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Vadomupindura vachiti, “Udozvahwa muzvitadzo zvizinji, waakuda kudzidzisa isisu futi?” Vadobva vamudzingira kunze kwosinagoge.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upofu hwoMweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Jesu paadonzva kuti vamubiritsa panze, uye paadodzomuwana adomuti, “Unotenda chere kuMwanakomana woMunhu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Adomupindura, “Changamire, ndiudzei kuti ndiyani kuti nditende kwaari?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Wamuona, futi ndiye ari kunyaira kwauri.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Adoti, “Ishe ndinotenda,” achibva wamunamata. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Jesu adoti, “Kutonga ndiko kwandidovinga panyika pano, kuti vaye vasingaone vaone, futi kuti vaye vanoona vave marombe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Vamwe vaFarisi vanga vari papfupi naye pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vadoti kwaari, “Naisisuwo tiri marombe chere?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Dai maiva marombe, maivaba nomhosva, asi zvino munoramba munomhosva nokuti munoti, munoona.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mufananidzo WaNyakabusa Adonaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri, uyo asingapindi mubara rohwai nopamusuwo, asi achikwira nopamwewo, munhu iyeyo mbavha nogororo. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Asi uyo anopinda nopamusuwo ndiye nyakabusa wohwai. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ndiye anozururihwa nomuchengeti wopamusuwo, hwai dzinonzva dzinga rache, futi anodaidza hwai dzache nomazita achidzikweerera kunze. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Kana wadziunganidza dzese kunze, anodzikweerera, idzo dzichimutevera, ndava dzinoziva dzinga rache. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Dzinoteveraba murendo, asi dzinotomutiza, ndava hadzizive dzinga rovarendo.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Mufananidzo wakareyu udoshandisiwa naJesu kwavari, asi vadonzvitsitsaba zvaaivanyepa.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Nyakabusa Adonaka</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Saka Jesu adonyaira kwavari pakare achiti, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, ndini sasa robara romahwai. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Vese vadondithangira kuuya, mbavha nomakororo, saka mahwai hayanai kuvatetekera. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ndini musuwo, wese zvache anopinda nopandiri anoponesewa, futi anopinda wobirika achiwana mafuro. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbavha inondouya kuti ibe, nokubaya nokupamwadza basi, ini ndidouya kuti vave noupenyu, kuti vave nahwo hudozara. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Ndini nyakabusa adonaka. Nyakabusa adonaka anopereka upenyu hwache nondava yomahwai. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Anenge ari wondomba asiri nyakabusa futi asiri muridzi womahwai, akaona svitsi richiuya anotiza achisiya mahwai, svitsi rinoyabvuta nokuyapamwadza. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Anotiza ndava ndowondomba asinai hanya nomahwai. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Ndini nyakabusa adonaka ndinoziva mahwai yangu futi mahwai yangu yanondiziva, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />sekuziva kwandinoitiwa naBaba nainini ndinoziva Baba futi ndinopereka upenyu hwangu nokuda kwomahwai. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Futi ndinodzimwe hwai, dzisiri dzobara rino, ndinofanirawo kuuya, dzichanzva dzinga rangu. Saka pachaita boka ribodzi nanyakabusa mubodzi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Nochikonzero chakarechi Baba vanondida, ndava ndinopereka upenyu hwangu, kuti ndidzohutora pakare. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Hapanai anohutora kwandiri, asi ndinohupereka ndega. Ndinosimba rokuhupereka, futi ndinosimba rokuhutora pakamu, murairo wakareyu ndidoupasiwa naBaba vangu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Padova nokupesana pakare pakati povaJudha nokuda kwomashoko yakareya. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Vazinji vavo vadoti, “Anoshave, futi ari kupenga, sei muchimutetekera?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Vamwewo vadoti, “Aya matauriroba youye anoshave. Shave ringaite kuti meso yorombe yaone?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorambiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yanga yava nguwa yomhepo, pamutambo wokupemberera kuKumikidziwa kwoimba yaMwari muJerusarema, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Jesu wanga achitekaira muchivanze choimba yaMwari, paberere raSoromoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Saka vaJudha vadomuunganira ndokuti kwaari, “Ucharamba uchida kuti timbondofungidzira kusvika rini? Kana uri Khirisitu wacho, tinyairire zvidojeka.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ndidokunyairirai, asi munotendaba. Mabasa yandinoita muzita raBaba vangu, yanondipupurira, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />asi hamutende ndava hamusi mahwai yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mahwai yangu yanonzva dzinga rangu, futi ndinoyaziva, pakamu yanonditevera, <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />futi ndinoyapasa upenyu husingapere, futi yanopfaba, hapanai achadzoyabvuta mujanja rangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Baba vangu vadondipasa iyo, mbakuru kuno vese, futi hapanai anokona kuyabvuta mujanja raBaba. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Inini naBaba tiri mubodzi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />VaJudha vadohwenga matombo pakare kuti vamuteme, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ndidokunangidzai mabasa yadonaka yadowanda yadobva kuna Baba, ndipi racho panaiyoya ramunonditemera nomatombo?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />VaJudha vadomupindura vachiti, “Tinokutemeraba basa ridonaka, asi kushora Mwari, ndava iwepa uri munhuwo zvache daipa, uri kuzviita Mwari.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Zvidonyohwaba mumutemo wenyu kuti, ‘Ndidoti muri anamwari?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Kana adovati, anamwari ivo vadopasiwa shoko raMwari, nokuti magwaro yangachohweba, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />mungati kuna iye adoitiwa mutsvene naBaba ndokutumiwa panyika, ‘Uri kushora Mwari,’ ndava ndati, ‘Ndiri Mwanakomana waMwari?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Kana ndisiri kuita mabasa yaBaba vangu, saka regai kunditenda ndipo, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />asi kana ndichiyaita, kana zvazvene imipa musinganditende, tendai mabasa, kuti muzive nokunzvitsitsa kuti Baba vari mandiri, nainini ndiri muna Baba.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vadoedza kumusunga pakare, asi adopukunyuka kubva mumaoko yavo. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Jesu adoenda pakare padonangarana nohwizi Jorodhani, panzvimbo Johwani yaadothanga kuwombekera, futi adoramba ari kwakareko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Futi vanhu vazinji vadoenda kwaari, ndokubva vati, “Johwani haanai kuita chiratidzo, asi zvese zvaadonyaira pamusoro pomunhu wakareyu nzvochokwadi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Futi vanhu vazinji panzvimbo yakareyo vadotenda kwaari.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Ipfa yaRazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Zvino umwe murume waiitiwa Razaro wanga achihwara, waibva kuBhetani, musha waMariya, mukoma nomunin'ina naMarita. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Uyu ndiye uye Mariya wokuzora Ishe mapfuta achipukuta tsoka dzaIshe nobvudzi rache, ndiye wanga anohanzvadzi yaihwara, yaiitiwa Razaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Saka hanzvadzi dzaRazaro dzidotumira shoko kuna Jesu dzichiti, “Ishe, uyeuye wamunoda wahwara.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Asi Jesu paadozvinzva adoti, “Kuhwara kwakareku hakusi kwoipfa, ndokwokuitira kuti Mwari akudziwe kuitira kuti Mwanakomana waMwari akudziwe nako” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Zvino Jesu waida Marita naMariya, naRazaro wacho. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Saka paadonzva kuti Razaro wahwara, adoita mazuva mairi adondogara panzvimbo yaanga ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo adoti kuvadzidzi vache, “Mbatiendei kuJudhiya pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vadzidzi vadoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, vaJudha vanga vachida kukutemai nomatombo, asi manje maakuenda kwakarekuye pakare?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Pazuva hapanai maawa gumi nomairi nai? Kana umwe munhu akatekaira masikati, haagwetsewe, ndava anovhenekehwa nochiedza chonyika. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Asi kana munhu akatekaira usiku, anogwetsewa, ndava haanai chiedza.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Wanyaira deipo, ndokudzoti kwavari, “Shamwari yedu Razaro waenzera, asi ndinoenda komumutsa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vadzidzi vadoti kwaari, “Ishe, kana waenzera, achapora.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Zvino Jesu wanga wanyaira zvoipfa yaRazaro, asi ivo vadofunga kuti waireva zvokundozorora adoenzera zvache. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Saka Jesu adodzovanyairira zviri pachenu, “Razaro wapfa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />futi nokuda kwenyu ndinofara kuti ndanga ndisipo, kuitira kuti mutende. Asi mbatiendei kwaari.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Thomasi, waiitiwa womamhasa adoti kuno vadzidzi biyache, “Tiendeiwo naye, kuti tipfe pabodzi naye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ndiye Kumuka Noupenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Zvino Jesu paadosvika, adowana Razaro watoisiwa muguwa, patova nomazuva manai. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bhetani ranga riri papfupi nokuJerusarema, kudondoita makhiromita matatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />vaJudha vazinji vanga vaenda kuna Marita naMariya kobata maoko nokuda kwomayanga yohanzvadzi yavo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marita paadonzva kuti Jesu wanga achiuya, adoenda kokumana naye, asi Mariya adoramba adogara mumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marita adoti kuna Jesu, “Ishe, dai manga muri pano, hanzvadzi yangu yaipfaba. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Asi naipopa ndinoziva kuti chese chamunokumbira kuna Mwari, Mwari anokupasai.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Hanzvadzi yako ichamuka pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita adoti kwaari, “Ndinoziva kuti achamuka pakare pakumuka kwozuva rokupedzisira.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ndini kumuka noupenyu; uyo anotenda kwandiri, kana akapfa, asi achararama, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />futi wese mupenyu anotenda kwandiri achapfaba. Unozvitenda chere?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Adoti kwaari, “Hinde, Ishe, ndinotenda kuti ndimi Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari, ari kuuya panyika.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Adorira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvo adoenda kodaidza Mariya mukoma nomunin'ina naye, achimuti nokazevezeve, “Mudzidzisi ari pano, futi ari kukudaidza.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Paadondozvinzva izvozvo, adosumuka nokamangu ndokuenda kwanga kuna Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Zvino Jesu wanga asati wapinda mumusha, asi wanga achiri panzvimbo yaadosangana naMarita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />VaJudha vanga vanaye mumba, vachimunyaradza, vadoona Mariya achisumuka kamangu achibirika, vadomutevera vachifunga kuti wanga achienda kuguwa korira ari ikoko.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Zvino Mariya paadosvika panga pana Jesu achimuona, adopfugama pasi pamberi potsoka dzache achiti kwaari, “Ishe, dai manga muri pano, hanzvadzi yangu yaipfaba.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Zvino Jesu paadomuona achirira, pabodzi novaJudha vaadouya navo, adodzamihwa mumweya wache ndokushushikana, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />futi adodzoti, “Mudomuviga poi?” Vadoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">“Ishe, uyai muone.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jesu adorira. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Saka vaJudha vadoti, “Onai kuti waimuda sei!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Asi vamwe vavo vadoti, “Wakareyu wokusvinudza meso yorombe, waikonaba nai kudziirira munhu wakareyu kuti areke kupfa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Razaro Anomutsiwa Pakupfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Zvino Jesu adonzva kudzamihwa pakare, ndokuenda paguwa, ranga riri bako, nodombo ridoisiwa pamuromo parene. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jesu adoti, “Biritsai dombo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Asi Marita, hanzvadzi yomupfi adoti kwaari, “Ishe iye manje wakutonuhwa, nokuti kwatopera mazuva manai wapfa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ko handinai kukunyairira kuti kana ukatenda uchaona kubhwinya kwaMwari?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Saka vadobiritsa dombo. Jesu adosimudza chiso chache ndokuti, “Baba ndinokutendai kuti mandinzva. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ndinoziva kuti munondinzva nguwa dzese, asi ndazvinyaira nondava yovanhu vadomira pano, kuti vatende kuti mudondituma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvi, adodaidzira nodzinga ropamusoro achiti, “Razaro, birika.” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Munhu adopfa adobirika muguwa, maoko nomakumbo yache yanga yadopomberedzewa nojira, chiso chache chidofukidziwa nofuko. Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mumononorei mapiza yomuguwa mumureke aende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupangana Kubaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Ruka 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Saka vaJudha vazinji vanga vauya naMariya vachiona zvidoitiwa naJesu, vadotenda kwaari, <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />asi vamwe vavo vadoenda kuvaFarisi ndokuvanyairira zvanga zvaitiwa naJesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Saka vatungamiri vovaphirisita novaFarisi vadounganidza dare, ndokuti, “Toita tini? Nokuti murume iyeyu ari kuita zviratidzo zvidowanda. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Tikamureka achienderera mberi daipa, vese vachatenda kwaari, ipopo vaRoma vanodzouya kopwanya zvese, imba yaMwari yedu norudzi redu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Asi mabiyawo waiitiwa Kefasi waiva muphirisita mukuru gore rakarero, adoti kwavari, “Hapanai chamunoziva peno, <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />munonzvitsitsaba kuti zvidokodzera kwamuri kuti munhu mubodzi apfire vanhu, pano kuti rudzi rese rirege kuparadziwa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Haanai kunyaira zvakarezvi nokuda kwache wega, asi nondava yokuva kwake muphirisita mukuru gore rakarero, adoporofita kuti Jesu waifanira kupfira rudzi rovaJudha, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />aikona kuti rudzi iroro rega, asi kuunganidza pabodzi vana vaMwari vadopamwarira pasi pese.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Saka kubva pazuva rakarero vadopangana kuti vangamubaye tini. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Zvino Jesu haanai kudzotekaira pachenu pakati povaJudha, asi adobirika achienda kudunhu rokunyasi kwosango, kuguta rinoitiwa Efuremu, futi adogara kwakareko novadzidzi vache. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Zvino Paseka mutambo wovaJudha, yanga yaakusvika, futi vazinji vadobva kumatunhu vachienda kuJerusarema Paseka isati yasvika, kuitira kuti vazvinatse. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Vanga vachitsvaga Jesu vachitonyairirana vadomira muimba yaMwari vachiti, “Munofungei? Kuti haangauye kumutambo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Manje vatungamiri vovaphirisita novaFarisi vanga vatsindikira vanhu vachiti, wese anenge wandoziva kwaiva naJesu, waifanira kuvaudza kuti vamusunge.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozodzewa paBhetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariko 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mazuva matanhatu Paseka isati yasvika Jesu adoenda kuBhetani kwaigara Razaro, waadomutsa kubva pakupfa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Vadomugadzirira zvokuja zvomauro, Marita adovapasa zvokuja, naRazaro wanga ari pabodzi novaiva patafura naJesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariya adotora chiyero chopakati nopakati chorita yochizoro chaidhura maninge chinoitiwa nadhi, ndokuchizora patsoka dzaJesu achidzipukuta nobvudzi rache, futi mumba mese mudozara kunushira. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Asi Judhasi Isikarioti, mumwe wovadzidzi vache, nyakudzomupandukira adoti, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Sei mapfuta yakareya yasinai kutengesewa nomadhinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muhoro wogore rese </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note> yopasiwa kuvarombo?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Adonyaira zvakarezvi, zvisingareve kuti waiva nohanya novarombo, asi nondava yokuti waiva mbavha, waigara nochikwama chomari waimbotora zvaiisiwa makaremo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Siyanai naye, rekai ayachengetere zuva rokuvigiwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Varombo munavo nguwa dzese, asi hamuve nainini nguwa dzese.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupangana Kubaya Razaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mhomho ikuru yovaJudha paidoziva kuti Jesu wanga ari muBhetani, vadoenda, vasingazviitire Jesu basi asi kuti vaone Razaro, waadomutsa kuvadopfa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Saka vatungamiri vovaphirisita vadoronga kubayawo naRazaro wacho, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ndava nokuda kwaRazaro vaJudha vazinji vanga vachivasiya vachitenda kuna Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupinda noKupemberehwa muJerusarema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Ruka 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Mangwana chimuka mhomho ikuru idouya kumutambo idonzva kuti Jesu wanga achipinda muJerusarema. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Saka vadochora tumathai tomichindwe ndokubirika kosangana naye vachidaidzira vachiti, “Hozana! Adokomborehwa iye anouya muzita raIshe, adokomborehwa Mambo wovaIzirairi!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Futi Jesu adowana kamwana kombongoro ndokukagadha, sezvazvidonyohwa,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Reka kucha mhandara yoZioni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Nangara mambo wako ari kuuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Adogadha kamwana kombongoro!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Vadzidzi vache vadozvinzvitsitsaba pakuthanga, asi Jesu paadokudziwa, ndopavadodzobengenuka kuti zvidonyohwa pamusoro pache futi kuti vadozviita kwaari. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Mhomho yanga inaye paadodaidza Razaro kubva muguwa ndokumumutsa pakupfa idoramba ichipasa upfakazi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ndochikonzero mhomho idoenda kosangana naye, vanga vanzva kuti adoita chiratidzo chakarecho. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Saka vaFarisi vadonyairirana vachiti, “Muri kuonaka kuti hapanai chinhu chamungaite, nangarai, vanhu vese vaakumutevera.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamwe vaGiriki Vanotsvaga Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Pakati povaye vadoenda konamata kumutambo paivawo nomaGiriki <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Vakarevo vadoenda kuna Firipi, waiva wokuBhetisaidha kuGaririya, vadoti kwaari “Changamire, tinodawo kuona Jesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Firipi adoenda koudza Andireya, Andireya adodzoenda naFiripi ndokuudza Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Nguwa yasvika yokuti Mwanakomana woMunhu akudziwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Chokwadi ndinokunyairirai kuti, kunze kwokunge mbeu yogorosi yawira muivhu yopfa, inogara iri yega, asi ikapfa, inoita zvibereko zvidowanda. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Uyo anoda upenyu hwache achataikihwa nahwo, asi uyo anovenga upenyu hwache pasi pano, achahuchengeta kuupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Wese anondishandira, anofanira kunditevera, futi pandinenge ndiri, pakarepo ndopachavawo nomuranda wangu, kana munhu achindishandira, Baba vachamukudza.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Zvoipfa Yache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Zvino mwoyo wangu waakutambudzika. Manje ndichati chii? Ndoti, Baba ndiponesei panguwa yakarei chere? Aiwa, nondava yakarei ndidouya panguwa idodai. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Baba, kudzai zita renyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Zvino izvi ridouya richibva kudenga ndokuti, “Ndatorikudza, futi ndicharikudza pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mhomho yanga idomira idozvinzva ndokubva yati, kwadhirima. Vamwe vadoti, “Ngirozi yanyaira naye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Jesu adovapindura, “Dzinga rakareri rauya nondava yenyu, aikona yangu inini. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Iye zvino kutongewa kwopasi pano kwasvika, iye zvino muchinda wopasi pano achataihwa kunze, <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />futi inini, kana ndasumudziwa kubva panyika, ndichakwevera vanhu vese kwandiri.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Adonyaira zvakarezvi kuti anangidze mapfiro yaaidzoita. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mhomho idomupindura, “Tidonzva kubva kumutemo kuti Khirisitu achararama nokusingapere. Unotaura tini uchiti Mwanakomana woMunhu anofanira kusimudziwa? Mwanakomana woMunhu wacho mbani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chiedza munacho kwokanguwa kapfupi zvishoma. Tekairai machiri, kuti mureke kusvikihwa norima, uyo anotekaira murima haazive kwaanoenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Muchinacho chiedza, tendai machiri kuti muve vana vochiedza.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Kutadza Kutenda Kwovanhu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jesu paadonyaira zvakarezvi adobirika achibva wavahwanda. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hundoriramuwa kuti mumasure mokunge Jesu waita zviratidzo zvizinji pamberi pavo, ivo havanai kumutenda, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />kuti shoko ridotauhwa nomuporofiti Isaya rizazisiwe rokuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Ishe mbani adotenda zvaadonzva kwatiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Futi simba renyu ridonangidziwa kunani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Saka vadotadza kutenda. Ndava Isaya anoti pakare,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Adovaita marombe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nokuomesa mwoyo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kuitira kuti vangadzoona nomeso yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nokunzvitsitsa nomwoyo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">vodzopindukira kwandiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">kuti ndivaporese.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya adonyaira zvakarezvi ndava adoona kubhwinya kwaJesu saka adonyaira pamusoro pache.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Zvidodaipo zvazvene vazinji naivowo vatungamiri vadotenda kwaari, asi nopamusaka pokucha vaFarisi havanai kuzviratidza pachena, kuti vareke kudzobiritsiwa musinagoge, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />ndava vaifarira kupembedzewa novanhu kupinda kupembedzewa naMwari.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutongewa noMazvi yaJesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Zvino Jesu adodaidzira achiti, “Uyo anotenda kwandiri, haatende kwandiri, asi kuno adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Futi wandiona inini waona uyo adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ndidouya ndiri sechiedza munyika, kuti wese anotenda kwandiri areke kumbondogara murima. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Wese anonzva kudzidzisa kwangu, woreka kukuteerera, ndinomutongaba, ndava ndidouyaba kudzotonga nyika, asi kudzoponesa nyika. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Uyo anondiramba asingatambire zvandinonyaira pano umwe anomutonga, mazvi yandidonyaira yachadzova mutongi wache pazuva rokupedzisira. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ndava ndidonyairaba musimba rangu ndega, asi Baba vadondituma ndivo vadondiraira zvokunyaira. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Futi ndinoziva kuti mutemo wache upenyu husingapere. Saka zvandinonyaira ndinonyaira sekuraihwa kwandinoitiwa naBaba.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoshambidza Tsoka Dzovadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Zvino mutambo woPhasika usati wasvika, Jesu achiziva kuti nguwa yache yasvika yokuti abirike panyika achienda kuna Baba, paadoda vache vanga vari panyika, adovada kusvika pakupedzisira. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Panguwa yokuja kwomauro, jabhurosi wanga watodira kare mumwoyo maJudhasi mwanakomana waSaimoni Sikariyoti pfungwa yokupandukira Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Jesu achiziva kuti Baba vadoisa zvese mumanja yache, futi kuti adouya kubva kuna Mwari futi kuti wanga achienda kuna Mwari, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />saka adosumuka kubva patafura ndokubisa jasi rache rokunze achidira padivi, achibva wazvisunga nothauro, <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />zvino adodururira mvura mumbiya ndokuthanga kushambidza tsoka vadzidzi achidzipukuta nothauro raanga adozvisunga naro. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Adosvika pana Simoni Pita, zvino Pita adobva wati kwaari, “Ishe, maakushambidza tsoka dzangu chere?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jesu adomupindura, “Zvandiri kuita hauzvizive iye manje, asi uchadzozvinzvitsitsa pasure.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Hamungamboshambidza tsoka dzangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jesu adomupindura, “Ndikareka kukushamba, haungave wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Pita adoti kwaari, “Ishe, aikona tsoka dzangu chete asi nomaoko yangu nomusoro wangu futi!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Uyo anenge washamba zvichadaba kuti ashambidziwe, kusiya kwomakumbo yacheyo chete, ndava watochena muviri wese, futi mudotochena, asi hamusi mese.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ndosaka adoti “Mudochenaba mese” ndava waiziva kuti mbani waidzomupandukira.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Paanga washamba tsoka dzavo watotora jasi rache achirisimira nokudzokera panzvimbo yache, adovabvunza achiti, “Manzvitsitsa chere zvandaita kwamuri? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Munondidaidza kuti Mudzidzisi uye Ishe, ipopo munokohorora, ndava ndozvandiri. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Manje kana inini Ishe wenyu noMudzidzisi, ndashamba tsoka dzenyu, saka munofanirawo kushambidzana tsoka. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nokuti ndakupasai muenzaniso, kuti muitewo zvandaita kwamuri. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ndinokunyepai chokwadi kuti, muranda haakurire tenzi wache, kana nhume haikurire anoituma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Kana muchiziva zvinhu izvozvi, mudokomborehwa kana muchizviita. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Handisi kureva imimi mese ndinoziva vandidosarura. Asi kuti gwaro rizadzisiwe, ‘Uyo wandaija naye zvokuja zvangu wandipandukira,’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ndinokunyairirai zvakarezvi iye zvino, zvisati zvaitika, kuti pazvinodzoitika mutende kuti Ndini Iye. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Chokwadi ndinokutaurirai kuti wese anotambira wandinotuma anotambirawo inini, futi anotambira inini anotambirawo adondituma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anogara Wataura Zvokupandukihwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mariko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Ruka 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Zvino Jesu paadonyaira zvakarezvo, adotambudzika mumweya wache ndokuti, “Chokwadi, umwe wenyu achandipandukira.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vadzidzi vadonangarana nangarana, vasingazive waanga achireva. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mumwe wovadzidzi vache, waidiwa naJesu, wanga adotsveyamira papfupi nochipfuwa chaJesu, <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />adotsvetehwa naSimoni Pita achimuti, “Mubvunze kuti ari kutaura ani.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Saka wanga ari papfupi naJesu adoti kwaari, “Ishe, angave yani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Nguyo wandichapasa chimepfu kana ndachiseva mumbenge.” Saka paadoseva chimepfu adochipasa Judhasi, mwanakomana waSimoni Sikariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Saka mumasure mokutora chimepfu chozingwa, Sathani adopinda muna Judhasi. Jesu adobva wati kwaari, “Zvese zvauchaita, ita nokukurumidza.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Zvino vanga vari patafura hapanai adoziva kuti sei adonyaira zvakarezvi kwaari. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Vamwe vadofunga kuti, ndava Judhasi waigara nohomwe yomari, saka Jesu waimunyepa kuti atenge zvavaida pamutambo, kana kuti waifanira kupasa zvimwe zvinhu kuvarombo.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Saka paadondotambira chimepfu, adoenda panze nokamangu, futi hwanga hwava usiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutemo Mutsva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Judhasi paadobirika, Jesu adoti, “Zvino Mwanakomana woMunhu wakudziwa, futi maari Mwari vakudziwa, <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Kana Mwari akudziwa maari, Mwari achakudzawo Mwanakomana maari, uye achamukudza kabodzi nokabodzi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Vana vangu, ndichava nemi kwokanguwa kadiki. Muchanditsvaga, sezvandidoudza vaJudha saka ndava kukuudzaiwo, ‘Kwandiri kuenda munokonaba kuuya.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndinokupasai mutemo mutsva, wokuti mudanane. Sekuda kwandidokuitai, naimimi mudanane daro. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Kana muchidanana vanhu vese vachaziva kuti muri vadzidzi vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anogara Wataura Zvokurambiwa naPita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Ruka 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Pita adomubvunza achiti, “Ishe, muri kuenda poi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jesu adomupindura kuti, “Kwandiri kuenda haugone kunditevera zvino, asi uchadzotevera pasure.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Ishe sei ndisingakone kukuteverai iye manje? Ndinopereka upenyu hwangu nokuda kwenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Uchapereka upenyu hwako nokuda kwangu chere? Chokwadi, ndinokunyepa kuti, uchandiramba katatu jongwe risati rarira.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Nzira Kuna Baba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Rekai kutambudzika mumwoyo; tendai muna Mwari, mutendewo mandiri. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mumba maBaba vangu muno nzvimbo dzizinji, dai zvisinai kudaro, ndaikunyepai nai kuti ndinoenda kokunhadzirirai nzvimbo? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Futi kana ndaenda kokunhadzirirai nzvimbo, ndinodzoka pakare kokutorai, kuti muvewo pandinenge ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Futi munoziva nzira yokwandiri kuenda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Thomasi adoti kwaari, “Ishe, tinozivaba kwamuri kuenda, ko tingazive tini nzira?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ndini nzira, nochokwadi, noupenyu, hapanai anouya kuna Baba, asi nopandiri. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Dai mudondiziva, maizivawo Baba vangu, kubva ipopa munovaziva futi mudovaona.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Firipi adoti kwaari, “Ishe, tinangidzei Baba, tichagutsikana.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Firipi, ndanga ndinemi pesepa, haunati wandiziva? Uyo anenge wandiona waona Baba. Unganyaire tini uchiti, ‘Tinangidzei Baba?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Unotendaba nai kuti ndiri muna Baba naBaba vari mandiri? Mazvi yandinonyaira kwamuri handinyaire musimba rangu ndega, asi Baba vanogara mandiri vanoita mabasa yavo. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nditendei kuti ndiri muna Baba naBaba mandiri, kana kuti nditendei nondava yomabasa yandinoita. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Chokwadi ndinokunyepai, uyo anotenda kwandiri achaitawo mabasa yandinoita, futi achaita mabasa yadokuritsa kukunda yakareya, ndava ndinoenda kuna Baba. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Zvese zvamunokumbira muzita rangu, ndichazviita, kuti Baba vakudziwe muMwanakomana, <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Kana mukakumbira chinhu chipi zvachene muzita rangu, ndichachiita.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anovavimbisa Mweya Mutsvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Kana muchindida, muchachengeta mitemo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Futi ndichanamata kuna Baba, ivo vachakupasai umwe Mubatsiri, kuti ave naimimi nokusingapere, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />iye Mweya wochokwadi, asingakone kutambihwa nonyika, ndava haimuone kana kumuziva, imimi munomuziva, ndava anogara naimimi, futi achava mamuri. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Handikusiyei mudoita kunge hungwa, ndichadzoka kwamuri. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Asi pakanguwa kadiki, nyika haindione futi, asi imimi muchandiona, ndava ndinorarama, naimipawo muchararama. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Pazuva rakarero muchaziva kuti ndiri muna Baba vangu, futi imimi muri mandiri, inini ndiri mamuri. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Uyo anomitemo yangu achiichengeta, ndiye chaiye anondida, futi anondida achadiwawo naBaba vangu, nainini ndichamuda futi ndichazvinangidza pachena kwaari.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judhasi, asiri Judhasi Sikariyoti, adoti kwaari, “Ishe, zvinofamba sei kuti munozvinangidza kwatiri, musingazvinangidze kunyika?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Kana munhu achindida, achatetekera kudzidzisa kwangu, futi Baba vangu vachamuda, futi tichauya kwaari toita musha wedu naye. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Uyo asingandide haaterere kudzidzisa kwangu, futi kudzidzisa kwamudonzva mhwanguba asi mhwaBaba vadondituma. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Ndakunyairirai zvinhu zvakarezvi, ndichiri nemi. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Asi Mubatsiri, Mweya Mutsvene, achatumiwa naBaba muzita rangu, achakufundisai zvinhu zvese, nokukufungisai zvese zvandidokunyepai. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Ndinokusiirai runyararo, runyararo rangu ndinokupasai. Handikupasei sekupasa kunoita nyika. Mwoyo yenyu mbaireke kutambudzika, futi rekai kucha. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mudondinzva ndichiti kwamuri, ‘Ndichaenda, futi ndichauya kwamuri,’ dai maindida, maitopfara, ndava ndinoenda kuna Baba, nokuti Baba mbakuru kwandiri. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Futi ndakunyairirai zvisati zvaitika, kuitira kuti kana zvaitika, mutende. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Handichanyaira zvidowanda naimimi, ndava muchinda wopasi pano ari kuuya. Haanai simba pamusoro pangu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />asi ndinoita sezvandidoraihwa naBaba, kuti nyika izive kuti ndinoda Baba. Sumukai, mbatiendei.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Muzambiringa Chaiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Ndini muzambiringa wochokwadi, futi Baba vangu murimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Thai rese riri mandiri risingaite muchero, anoritema, futi thai rese rinoita michero anorichekerera, kuti riite michero mizinji. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mudotonatsiwa kare nokudzidzisa kwandidonyaira kwamuri. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Garai mandiri, nainini mamuri. Fanike thai risingakone kuita muchero riri rega, kana risiri pamuzambiringa, naimimiwo hamugone kubereka muchero, asi kutoti muchigara mandiri basi.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Ndini muzambiringa, imimi muri mathai. Uyo anogara mandiri, nainini maari, ndiye anoita muchero idowanda, nokuti pasina inini hapanai chamunoita. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Kana munhu asingagare mandiri, anogwatiwa kunge thai wooma, futi mathai yadodaro yanounganidziwa yokhandihwa mumoto yopisiwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Kana mukagara mandiri, nomashoko yangu yachigara mamuri, kumbirai zvese zvamunoda, muchazviitihwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Kukudziwa kwaBaba vangu kunonangidziwa nokubereka kwenyu muchero idowanda, zvakarezvo ndizvo zvamudoitira vadzidzi vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kunge kudiwa kwandidoitiwa naBaba, ndomwenze madiro yandinokuitai, garai murudo rangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Kana mukachengeta mitemo yangu, muchagara murudo rangu, fanike kuchengeta kwandidoita mitemo yaBaba vangu ndokugara murudo ravo.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Zvinhu zvakarezvi ndidokunyairirai kuti mufaro wangu uve mamuri, futi kuti mufaro wenyu uzare. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Uku ndiko kuraira kwangu, kwokuti mudane sezvandidokudai imimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Hapanai anorudo rinokunda rakareri, rokuti munhu anopfira shamwari dzache. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Muri shamwari dzangu kana muchiita zvandinokurairai. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Handichakudaidzai kuti vashandi, nokuti mushandi anozivaba zviri kuitiwa tenzi wache, asi ndidokudaidzai kuti shamwari, nokuti zvese zvandidonzva kuna Baba ndidokuzivisai. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Hamunai kundisarudza, asi ndidokusarudzai nokukugadzai kuti muende kobereka muchero futi kuti muchero wenyu urambe uripo, kuitira kuti chipi nochipi chamunokumbira Baba muzita rangu, vakupasei chakarecho. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Uku ndiko kuraira kwangu, kuti mudanane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chizondo choNyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Kana nyika ichikuzondai, zivai kuti idondizonda isinati yakuzondai imimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Dai muri vonyika, nyika yaikudai sevanhu vayene. Asi ndidokusarudzai kubva munyika ino saka hamusi vonyika ndokusaka nyika ichikuzondai. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Yeukai shoko randidokunyepai rokuti, ‘Muranda haakurire tenzi wache.’ Kana inini vadonditambudza, vachakutambudzaiwo, kana vadochengeta shoko rangu, vachachengetawo renyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Asi zvese zvakarezvi vachakuitirai nokuti muri vangu, ndava havazive uyo adondituma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Dai ndisinai kuuya ndichinyaira kwavari, dai vasinai chitadzo, manje havanai mapukunyukiro yavachaita pamusoro pochitadzo chavo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Uyo anondivenga anovengawo Baba wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Dai ndisinai kuita mabasa yasinai kumboitiwa noumwe munhu pakati pavo, dai vasinai zvitadzo, asi manje vadoona ndokuvenga tese inini naBaba vangu.” <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Izvi zvidoitika kuti shoko riri mumutemo wavo riitike rinoti, “Vadondivenga pasinai nyiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Kana Mubatsiri wauya, wandichakutumirai kubva kuna Baba, iye Mweya wochokwadi, anobva panaBaba, achapasa upfakazi pamusoro pangu, <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />naimimi muri pfakaziwo, ndava manga muneni kubvira pakuthanga.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Ndidonyaira kwamuri zvakarezvi zvese kuti mureke kuwa pakutenda. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Vachakubiritsai mumasinagoge, chokwadi nguwa iri kuuya yokuti wese anokubayai anofunga kuti ari kushandira Mwari. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Futi vachaita zvakarezvi ndava havanai kuziva Baba, kana inini. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Asi ndidonyaira zvakarezvi kwamuri, kuti kana nguwa yazvene yasvika muyeuke kuti ndidokuudzai pamusoro pazvene.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Basa roMweya Mutsvene</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Ndidonyairaba kwamuri zvinhu zvakarezvi pakuthanga, ndava ndanga ndinemi. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Asi manje ndaakuenda kuno adondituma, hapanai wenyu ari kundibvunza kuti, ‘Muri kuenda poi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Futi pandakunyepai zvinhu zvakarezvi, mwoyo yenyu yazara nokusuwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Zvisinei ndinokunyairirai chokwadi: zvidotonakira imimi kuti ndiende, ndava ndikarega kuenda, Mubatsiri anouyaba kwamuri, asi kana ndikaenda, ndinomutuma kwamuri. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Futi kana auya, achakomwesa nyika pamusoro pochitadzo nopamusoro pokururama nopamusoro pokutongewa. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Havanai kukohoroka pamusoro pochitadzo, ndava havatendi kwandiri. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Havanai kukohoroka pamusoro pokururama, ndava ndinoenda kuna Baba, futi muchandionaba kamu, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />futi pamusoro pokutongewa, ndava mubati wopasi pano watotongewa. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Ndino zvidowanda zvokunyaira kwamuri, asi munokonaba kuzvibata manje. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kana Mweya wochokwadi wauya, achakutungamirirai muchokwadi chese, nokuti achanyairaba musimba rache wega, asi chese chaachanzva achachinyaira, futi achakuudzai zvinouya. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Achatora shoko rangu achikupasai. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Zvese zvinaBaba nzvangu, ndosaka ndati achatora zvandinomupasa achikuudzai.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusuwa Kunosanduka kuva Mufaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Mukanguwa kadiki, muchandionaba, asi musure mokanguwa kadiki modzondiona pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Vamwe vovadzidzi vache vadonyairirana vachiti, “Anorevei kana achiti, ‘Mukanguwa kadiki, muchandionaba, asi musure mokanguwa kadiki modzondiona pakare. Ndava ndinoenda kuna Baba?’” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Vadoti, “Anoreva chii paanoti, ‘kanguwa kadiki?’ Tinozivaba zvaanoreva.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Jesu adoziva kuti vaida kumubvunza, saka adoti kwavari, “Ndozvamuri kuzvibvunza nai izvozvi, kuti ndinorevei kana ndichiti, ‘Kanguwa kadiki, munondionaba, pakare kanguwa kadiki, futi muchandiona futi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, mucharira nokuita maundu, asi nyika ichafara, muchasuwa, asi kusuwa kwenyu kuchapinduka kuva mufaro. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Kana mukadzi waakupona anova nokusuwa, nokuti nguwa yache yasvika, asi kana wapona mwana, anokangamwa kutambura kuye, nondava yokufarira kuti mwana wazvahwa panyika. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Saka munosuwa iye manje, asi ndichakuonai pakare futi muchapfara, hapanai achakutorerai mufaro wenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Pazuva rakarero hapanai chamuchandikumbira. Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, mukakumbira Baba chinhu chipi zvachene muzita rangu vanokupasai. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kusvika ipopa hamusati makumbira chinhu muzita rangu, kumbirai, muchapasiwa, kuti mufaro wenyu uzare.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukunda Nyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Ndanyaira kwamuri zvakarezvi nodimikira, nguwa iri kuuya pandicharega kunyaira kwamuri nodimikira asi ndichanyaira zviri pachenu pamusoro paBaba. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Pazuva rakarero muchakumbira muzita rangu, futi handiti kwamuri ndichakukumbirirai kuna Baba, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />nokuti Baba pachavo vanokudai, ndava mudondida futi mudotenda kuti ndidobva kuna Baba. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ndidobva kuna Baba futi ndidouya panyika, ndiri kubirika panyika futi ndiri kuenda kuna Baba pakare.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Vadzidzi vache vadoti, “Hamuone, manje maakunyaira zviri pachenu, aikona nobimikira! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Manje taakuziva kuti munoziva zvinhu zvese, futi hapanai angakubvunzei, nokuda kwozvakarezvi tinotenda kuti mudobva kuna Mwari.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Munotenda manje chere? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nguwa iri kuuya, izvozvi yatouya, pamuchapamwadziwa, mumwe nomumwe kumba kwache futi muchandisiya ndega. Asi handisi ndega, ndava Baba vaneni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndakunyairirai zvakarezvi, kuti muve norugare mandiri. Munyika munotambudziwa, asi tsungai mwoyo, inini ndakunda nyika.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonamatira Vadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Jesu paadonyaira mazvi yakareya, adonangara kudzuru ndokuti, “Baba, nguwa yasvika. Kudzai Mwanakomana kuti Mwanakomana akukudzei, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />ndava mudomupasa simba pamusoro povanhu vese, kuti apase upenyu husingapere kuno vese vamudomupasa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Futi uhu ndihwo upenyu husingapere, kuti vakuzivei imimi Mwari wega wochokwadi, naJesu Khirisitu wamudotuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ndidokukudzai panyika, nokupedzisa basa ramudondipasa kuti ndiite. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Zvino Baba, ndikudzei pamberi penyu nokukudziwa kwanga ndinako ndinaimimi nyika isati yagadzihwa.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Ndaita kuti zita renyu rizikane novanhu vamudondipasa panyika, vanga vari venyu, futi mudovapasa kwandiri, futi vadochengeta shoko renyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Manje vaakuziva kuti zvese zvamudondipasa zvidobva kwamuri, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />nokuti ndidovapasa mashoko yamudondipasa, futi vadoyatambira, vadoziva zvochokwadi kuti ndidobva kwamuri, futi vadotenda kuti imimi mudondituma.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ndiri kuvanamatira ndiri kunamatiraba nyika asi vakareva vamudondipasa, ndava mbenyu, <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />vese vangu mbenyu, futi venyu mbangu, pakare ndinokudziwa kuburikidza nomavari. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Futi handichava panyika, asi ivo vari panyika, inini ndiri kuuya kwamuri. Baba vatsvene, vachengetei muzita renyu, ramudondipasa, kuti vave vabodzi, sezvatiri mubodzi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Pandaiva navo, ndidovachengeta muzita renyu ramudondipasa, ndidovachengeta, futi hapanai umwe wavo adotaika asi mwanakomana wokuparadziwa, kuti gwaro rizazisiwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Asi zvino ndiri kuuya kwamuri, futi zvinhu zvakarezvi ndinozvinyaira panyika, kuti mufaro wangu uzazisiwe mavari. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ndidovapasa shoko renyu, nyika ndokuvavenga ndava mbonyikaba, kunge inini ndisiri wonyika. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ndinonamataba kuti muvabiritse panyika, asi kuti muvachengete kubva kuno uyo adoipa. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Havasi vonyika, fanike inini ndisiri wonyika. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Vaitei vatsvene muchokwadi shoko renyu ndiro chokwadi. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kunge kutuma kwamudondiita panyika, saka ndidovatuma kunyika. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nokuda kwavo ndinozviita mutsvene, kuitira kuti vaitiwewo vatsvene muchokwadi.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Handinamatire vakareva chete, asi noavo vanotendawo kwandiri kuburikidza noshoko ravo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />kuti vese vave mubodzi, kunge imipa, Baba muri mandiri, nainini ndiri mamuri. Ndinonamatira kuti vavewo matiri, kuitira kuti nyika itende kuti mudondituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Kubhwinya kwamudondipasa ndidovapasa, kuti vave mubodzi kunge isisu tiri mubodzi, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />inini ndiri mavari futi imimi muri mandiri, kuti vanatse kuita mubodzi, kuitira kuti nyika izive kuti mudondituma futi kuti mudovada zvidofanana nokundida kwamudoita.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Baba, ndinoditsa kuti vakareva vamudondipasa, vave nainini pandinenge ndiri, kuti vaone kubhwinya kwangu kwamudondipasa murudo renyu nyika isati yavapo. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Baba vadorurama, kunyange nyika isinai kukuzivai, asi inini ndidokuzivai, futi ava vanoziva kuti mudondituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ndidoita kuti vakuzivei, futi ndicharamba ndichiiita kuti muziviwe, kuitira kuti rudo ramudondida naro ruvewo mavari, kuti inini pachangu ndive mavari.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Kusungiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Ruka 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Jesu paadotaura mashoko yakareya, adobirika achienda novadzidzi vache ndokuyambukira kudonangarana nomupata woKhidhironi, kwaiva nodimba raadopinda novadzidzi vache. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Zvino Judhasi, adomupandukira waizivawo nzvimbo yacho, ndava Jesu waimbosangana novadzidzi vache pakarepo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Saka Judhasi adotorana noboka romauto novarindi voimba yaMwari vadobva kuvatungamiri vovaphirisita novaFarisi, vadoenda kudimba racho, vanga vadotakura marambe nomwenje nozvombo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Zvino Jesu nokuziva zvese zvanga zvichidzouya paari, adotekaira ari pamberi ndokubva wavati, “Mbani wamuri kutsvaga?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Vadomupindura kuti, “Jesu woNazareta.” Jesu adoti kwavari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">“Ndini wacho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judhasi, nyakumupandukira wanga adomira navo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Jesu paadoti kwavari, “Ndini wacho,” vadosuduruka mumasure ndokuwira pasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Adovabvunza pakare, “Mbani wamuri kutsvaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Ivo vadoti, “Jesu woNazareta.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ndakunyairirai kuti ndini wacho, saka kana muchitsvaga inini, rekai varume ava vaende.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Izvozvi zvanga zvichizazisa mashoko yaanga wataura yokuti, “Pano avo vamudondipasa hapanai wandidotaya.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Ndava Simoni Pita wanga anobakatwa, adoribiritsa ndokukhwapa naro muranda womuphirisita mukuru, adobva wagwatika nzeve yokuruji. Zita romuranda wacho raiitiwa Marikasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Jesu adoti kuna Pita, “Dira bakatwa rako munhava yarene, ndorega nai kumwa mukombe wokutambudzika wandapasiwa naBaba?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoendesewa kunaAnasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Zvino boka romauto nomukuru wavo novatariri vovaJudha vadobata Jesu ndokumusunga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Vadothanga kuenda naye kuna Anasi, ndava waiva atezvara vaKaefasi, wanga ari muphirisita mukuru pagore rakarero. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ndiye Kefasi wokupasa nzeru vatungamiri vovaJudha yokuti zvanga zviri hasa kuti munhu mubodzi apfire vanhu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anoramba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Mateo 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mariko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Ruka 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Pita noumwe mudzidzi vadotevera Jesu. Nokuti mudzidzi wakareyo waizikana nomuphirisita mukuru, adopinda pabodzi naJesu muimba yomuphirisita mukuru yokutongera, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Pita wanga adomira panze pamusuwo. Saka umwe mudzidzi waizikana nomuphirisita mukuru, adobirika ndokunyaira nomushandirikadzi waichengeta pamusuwo, ndokupinza Pita mukati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mushandirikadzi iyeyo waichengeta pamusuwo adoti kuna Pita, “Naiwe, ndiweba umwe pakare wovadzidzi vomurume wakareyu chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Adoti, “Handizi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kwanga kuchitonhora saka vashandi novarindi voimba yaMwari vanga vabatidza moto womarasha, vadomira zvavo vachigotha moto. Pita adomira zvache navo achigothawo moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muphirisita Mukuru Anobvunzitsitsa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Ruka 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Zvino muphirisita mukuru adobvunza Jesu nozvovadzidzi vache nozvokudzidzisa kwache pakamu. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Ndidonyaira pachenu kuvanhu vese, ndidodzidzisa nguwa dzese mumasinagoge nomuimba yaMwari, paiungana pabodzi vaJudha vese, hapanai chandidonyairira padohwanda. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Sei uri kundibvunza? Bvunza vadondinzva kuti ndidotaura chii kwavari, vanoziva zvandidonyaira.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvi, umwe mutariri angaadomira panyasi adorova Jesu nombama, achiti, “Ndomapinduriro yaunoita muphirisita mukuru yoya?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jesu adomupindura, “Kana ndanyaira zvidonyangara zvinyaire kuti nzvipi, asi kana ndanyaira zvidokohoroka, uri kundiroverei?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anasi adodzotumira Jesu adosungiwa kuna Kayafasi muphirisita mukuru.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anoramba Jesu Pakare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mateo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mariko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Ruka 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Zvino Simoni Pita wanga adomira achigotha moto. Vadoti kwaari, “Iwepa futi ndiweba mumwe wovadzidzi vache here iwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Asi Pita adozviramba achiti, “Ndiniba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umwe wovashandi vomuphirisita mukuru, hama yaiyeuye wokugwatiwa nzeve naPita, adomubvunza achiti, “Naiwe, ko handinai chere kukuona mudimba unaye?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Pakare, Pita adozviramba zvakarezvo. Kabodzi nokabodzi jongwe ridobva rarira.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoisiwa kuna Pirato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Ruka 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Zvino vadobva kumba kwaKefasi ndokumuendesa kumuzinda womutongi woRoma. Yanga yari mambakwedza. Ivo pachavo havanai kupinda mumuzinda, kuti vareke kusvipisiwa, asi kuti vaje paseka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Saka Pirato adobirika ndokuti kwavari, “Imhosva yei yamuri kunenera murume uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vadomupindura vachiti, “Dai murume wakareyu asiri muchori womutemo, taimuperekaba kwamuri”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pirato adoti kwavari, “Mutorei mumutonge mega nomutemo wenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">VaJudha vadoti kwaari, “Hazvisi pamutemo kuti titongere munhu ipfa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Izvozvi zvanga zviri kuzadzisa shoko ridonyaihwa naJesu kuonesa ipfa yaaidzopfa nayo.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pirato adopinda mumuzinda pakare ndokudaidza Jesu, achiti kwaari, “Ndiwe mambo wovaJudha chere?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Uri kunyaira zvakarezvi pachako chere, kana kuti vamwewo vakuudza izvozvi pamusoro pangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pirato adopindura achiti, “Inini ndiri muJudha chere? Vorudzi rako futi vatungamiri vovaphirisita ndivo vakupereka kwandiri, chii chawaita?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jesu adopindura achiti, “Umambo hwangu hahuzi hwopasi pano, dai umambo hwangu huri hwepasi pano, varanda vangu vaihwisa, kuti ndirege kusungiwa novatungamiri vovaJudha, asi umambo hwangu hahubve pasi pano.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pirato adoti kwaari, “Saka uri mambo chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jesu adopindura achiti, “Wazvinyaira kuti ndiri mambo. Nondava yakarei ndidozvahwa, futi nokuda kwozvakarezvi ndidouya panyika, kuti ndipe upfakazi hwochokwadi. Wese anenge ari wochokwadi anonzva izvi rangu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pirato adomubvunza achiti, “Chokwadi chii?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jesu Anotongehwa Ipfa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mateo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mariko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Ruka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Musure mokunyaira zvakarezvi, adobirika kunze pakare kuvaJudha, ndokuvanyepa, “Ndinoonaba mhosva kwaari.”<verse eid="JHN 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />“Asi munotsika yokuti ndinofanira kukubiritsirai muusungwa mubodzi paPhasika. Ndokubiritsirai Mambo wovaJudha chere?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Vadodaidzira pakamu, “Aikona munhu iyeyu, asi Bharabhasi!” Manje Bharabhasi wanga ari gororo.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Zvino Pirato adotora Jesu ndokumurova. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Futi mauto yadorukha ngundu yomwinza, ndokuiisa mumusoro mache, futi vadomusimidza jasi ridotsvukuruka, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Vadoramba vachiuya kwaari vachiti, “Moroi Mambo wovaJudha!” Futi vadomurova mambama.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pirato adobirika panze pakare, ndokuti kwavari, “Nangarai, ndaakumubiritsa kunze kwamuri, kuti muzive kuti mhosva yache ndaisairira.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Saka Jesu adobirika panze adosimira ngundu yomwinza nojasi ridotsvukuruka. Pirato adoti kwavari, “Munhu ndiyeyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vakuru vovaphirisita novatungamiri vovanhu pavadondomuona, vadodaidzira vachiti, “Murovererei pamuchinjikwa, murovererei pamuchinjikwa!” Pirato adoti kwavari, “Mutorei mega mumuroverere pamuchinjikwa, ndava inipano ndasaya mhosva yache.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Vatungamiri vovaJudha vadomupindura vachiti, “Tinomutemo, nomutemo wakareyo anofanira kupfa, ndava anozviti Mwanakomana waMwari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pirato paadonzva mazvi yakareya adotonyanyitsirafuti kucha, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />adopinda mumuzinda pakare ndokuti kuna Jesu, “Uri wopoi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Asi Jesu adomupinduraba. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pirato adodzoti kwaari, “Unoreka kunyaira kwandiri? Unozivaba nai kuti ndinomasimba yokukusugudura, nomasimba yokukuroverera pamuchinjikwa?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Unoitaba simba pamusoro pangu iwe, kusiya kwokunge waripasiwa kubva kumusoro, saka wandipereka kwauri ndiye anochitadzo chikuru.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kubva panguwa yakareyo Pirato adotsvaga zano rokumusunungura, asi vatungamiri vovaJudha vadodaidzira vachiti, “Kana ukasunungura munhu wakareyu, unotsvatsvana naKhesari, wese anozviita mambo anenge achitozviita mhandu yaKhesari.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pirato paadonzva mazvi yakareyo, adobiritsa Jesu panze, ndokugarikika pamupando wokutonga uri panzvimbo yomabhwe inoitiwa Gabhata muchiHebheru. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Manje iroro ranga riri zuva roGadziriro yoSabata, yava masikati paawa yochitanhatu. Adoti kuvaJudha, “Onai mambo wenyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Vadodaidzira vachiti, “Mubiritsei pano! Muroverei!” Vatungamiri vovaphirisita vadopindura vachiti, “Hatinai umwe mambo kusiya kwaKesari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Saka adomupereka kwavari kuti arovehwe pamuchinjikwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jesu Anorovehwa Pamuchinjikwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Ruka 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Saka vadotora Jesu <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Adobirika adotakura muchinjikwa wache, ndokuenda kunzvimbo inoitiwa Kadehenya, asi muchiHebheru ichiitiwa Gorogota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Pakarepo vadomurovera pamuchinjikwa, pabodzi novamwe vairi, vanga vari kumativi yache, iye ari pakati pavo. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pirato adonyora chikwangwari chaiti, “Jesu woNazareta, Mambo wovaJudha” ndokuchiturika pamuchinjikwa <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />VaJudha vazinji vadoriverenga, ndava panzvimbo panga padorovehwa Jesu, panga pari papfupi nomuguta, futi panga padonyohwa muchiHebheru, muchiRatini nomuchiGiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Vatungamiri vovaphirisita novakuru vovaJudha vadodzoti kuna Pirato, “Reka kunyora kuti, ‘Mambo wovaJudha,’ asi kuti, Munhu uyu waiti, ‘Ndiri Mambo wovaJudha.’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pirato adopindura achiti, “Zvandanyora ndanyora.” <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Mauto pavadorovera Jesu vadotora zvipfeko zvache ndokuzviita zvipenga zvinai, uto regarega ridoita charene, nochipfeko chache chomukati. Asi chipfeko chomukati changa chisinai musono, changa chidondoita chibodzi kubva kumusoro kusvika kumukombero, <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Mauto yadonyairirana yachiti, “Mbatiregei kurikerura, asi mbatikhandei hakata kuti tione kuti richava raani.” Zvakarezvi zvanga zviri kuzazisa gwaro rinoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Vadokovana majasi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ndokukhanda hakata pazvipfeko zvangu.” Saka mauto yadoita zvakarezvi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Panyasi pomuchinjikwa waJesu panga padomira Mariya, amai vache nomunin'ina wavo, naMariya mukadzi waKhiropasi, naMariya Magadharini. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Jesu paadoona amai vache, nomudzidzi waaida vadomira papfupi, adoti kuna maache, “Amai, uyu ndiye mwanakomana wenyu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Manje adodzoti kumudzidzi, “Ava ndivo amai vako!” Futi kubvira pakarepo mudzidzi adovatora kuenda kogara navo kumba kwache.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Ruka 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi, Jesu achiziva kuti zvese zvanga zvapera, kuti azazise gwaro adoti, “Ndava nonyota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Panga pano mbiya idozara vhiniga pakarepo, saka vadotora siponji ndokuijungirira kukamuti kohisopu ndokuinyika muvhiniga vachibva vaiisa kumuromo kwache. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Zvino Jesu paadondosvuta vhiniga, adoti, “Zvapera,” Ipopo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">adogurama ndokuregedzera mweya wache achibva warosa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anobayiwa Padivi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nondava yokuti ranga riri Zuva Rogadziriro, kuti vareke kusiya zvitunha zviri pamuchinjikwa paSabata ndava Sabata yakarei yanga iri zuva rinokosha, vaJudha vadokumbira Pirato kuti makumbo yovadorovehwa vacho yachohwe, uye kuti vabiritsiwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Saka mauto yadoenda ndokuchora makumbo yowokuthanga, noyoumwe waanga adoroverehwawo pabodzi naye, <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />asi pavadosvika panga pana Jesu vachiona kuti wanga wapfa kare, havanai kumuchora makumbo yache. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Asi rimwe uto ridomubaya parutivi nopfumo, ndokubva gazi nomvura zvabirika pakarepo, <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Iye adozviona adopasa upfakazi - upfakazi hwache ngwochokwadi, futi anoziva kuti anonyaira chokwadi, kuitira kuti naimimiwo mutende. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ndava zvinhu zvakarezvi zvidoitika kuti gwaro rizadzisiwe rinoti, “Hapanai bvupa rache richachohwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Pakare rimwe gwaro rinoti, “Vachanangara kuna iye wavadojunga.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvigiwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Ruka 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Mumasure mozvakarezvo Josefa woAramatiya, wanga ari mudzidzi waJesu, asi asingazikane, nondava yokucha vatungamiri vovaJudha, adokumbira Pirato kuti amubvumire kutora chitunha chaJesu, Pirato adobva wamupasa mvumo. Saka adoenda ndokuburutsa chitunha chaJesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodhimo wokuenda kuna Jesu usiku, adouyawo nomusanganisiwa womura nogavakava zvairema makhirogiramu makumi matatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Vadotora chitunha chaJesu, ndokuchiputiridza nofuko pabodzi nozvinonushira, mumaitiro yotsika yovaJudha kana vachiviga chitunha. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Zvino panyasi ponzvimbo paiva nodimba uye mudimba manga munoguwa ritsva ranga risina adombovigiwa makaremo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Saka nondava yozuva Rogadziriro yovaJudha, vadobva vaviga Jesu muguwa rakarero ranga riri papfupi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Guwa Risinai Chinhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Ruka 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Zvino nozuva rokuthanga rosondo Mariya wokuMagadhara adofumira kuenda kuguwa, utonga huchidotsvuka, ndokuona kuti dombo ranga riri pamuromo poguwa ranga rabiritsiwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Saka adomhanyira kuna Simoni Pita nokunoumwe mudzidzi, uyeuye waidiwa naJesu, ndokuti kwavari, “Vabiritsa Ishe muguwa, futi tinozivaba kwavamuisa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Pita adobva wabirika nomudzidzi biyache vadonanga kuguwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Vadotizira vese, asi mudzidzi umwe adosiya Pita ndokuthanga kusvika paguwa, <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Paadosongorera achinangara adoona fuko ridondoti kwobvo makaremo, asi haanai kupinda mukati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Saka Simoni Pita waitevera, adodzosvikawo, ndokupinda muguwa, achiona mapiza nofuko zvidondoti kwobvo, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />norimwe jira ranga ridomonerera musoro wache, ranga ridotopetewa ridoisiwa parene rega. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Zvino uye umwe mudzidzi, wanga wathanga kusvika paguwa, adodzopindawo, ndokuona achibva watenda, <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />nokuti vanga vasati vanzvitsitsa gwaro rokuti waifanira kumuka kuvadopfa. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Saka vadzidzi vadodzodzoka vachienda kudzimba dzavo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozvinangidza kuna Mariya woMagadhara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mateo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mariko 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariya adomira kunze kwoguwa achirira, achirira daipo adokotama achisongorera muguwa, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />adobva waona ngirozi dziiri dzidosimira zvichena, dzidogarikika panga padoradzikiwa chitunha chaJesu, imwe yanga iri kumusoro imwe kumakumbo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Dzidoti kwaari, “Amai imi, muri kurirei?” Adoti kwadziri, “Ndava vadotora Ishe wangu, futi ndinozivaba kwavadomuisa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Paadonyaira zvakarezvo adocheuka kumasure ndokuona Jesu adomira, asi haanai kumuziva kuti ndiJesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Amai imi, sei muri kurira? Mbani wamuri kutsvaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Achifunga kuti ndiye waichengeta dimba, adoti kwaari, “Changamire, kana mamubiritsa, ndiudzei kwamamuisa, kuti ndimutore.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jesu adomudaidza achiti, “Mariya.” Iye adochununguka ndokuti kwaari muchiHebheru, “Rabhoni!” zvinoreva kuti mudzidzisi. <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Reka kundibata, ndava handinati ndakwira kuna Baba, asi enda kuhama dzangu, wovanyepa kuti ndiri kukwira kuna Baba vangu naBaba venyu, kuna Mwari wangu naMwari wenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariya wokuMagadhara adoenda ndokuti kuvadzidzi, “Ndaona Ishe, futi wandinyepa zvakarezvi zvese.”<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozvinangidza Kuvadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Ruka 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Kumauro kwozuva rakarero rokuthanga kwosondo, vadzidzi vanga vadoungana pabodzi vadovhara sasa romumba mavanga vari nondava yokucha vatungamiri vovaJudha, Jesu adosvika ndokuti puru pakati pavo achiti kwavari, “Runyararo kwamuri.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Mumasure mukunyaira zvakarezvi, adobva wavanangidza manja yache noparutivi pache. Saka vadzidzi vadodzokondwa pavadoona Ishe. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Pakare Jesu adoti kwavari, “Runyararo mbarive nemi. Sekutumiwa kwandidoitiwa naBaba naininiwo ndinokutumai.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Futi paadonyaira zvakarezvi, adovafuridzira, ndokuti kwavari, “Tambirai Mweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Kana munhu upi zvache wamaregerera zvitema, watoregerehwa, kana mukasaregerera zvitema munhu upi zvache haaregerehwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naTomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Manje Thomasi, waiitiwa woMamhasa ari umwe wovanogumi novairi, anga asiri pabodzi naabiyache padouya Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Saka vadzidzi biyache vadomunyepa vachiti, “Taona Ishe.” Asi adoti kwavari, “Kusiya kwokutoti ndatoona mbonje mumaoko yache, ndabata nokakumo kangu mbonje dzozvipikiri, nokubata nojanja rangu parutivi pache ndinotendaba.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Mumasure momazuva masere, vadzidzi vache vanga vari mumba pakare, naTomasi anga anavo. Masasa yanga yadozarihwa, asi Jesu adouya ndokuti puru pakati pavo, adobva wati, “Runyararo mbarive kwamuri.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Manje adodzoti kuna Thomasi, “Isa kakumo kako apa, uone maoko yangu futi, utambanudze ruoko rako, uriise parutivi pangu, reka kutsakidza, asi tenda.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Thomasi adomupindura achiti, “Ishe wangu naMwari wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Watenda ndava wandiona? Vadoropafadziwa vasinai kuona asi vachitenda.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa Chobhuku Rakareri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Zvino Jesu adoita zvimwe zviratidzo zvizinji pamberi povadzidzi, zvisinai kunyorewa mubhuku rakareri, <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />asi zvakarezvi zvidonyorehwa kuti mutende kuti Jesu ndiye Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari, futi matenda daipo mova noupenyu muzita rache.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Anozvinangidza Kuvadzidzi Vanomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mumasure mozvakarezvi Jesu adobirika pachenu kuvadzidzi panyasi pogungwa roTaibheriyasi, futi adozvionesa nomutoo udodai. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Pita, Thomasi waiitiwa womaMhasa, naNatanieri wokuKhana roGaririya, vanakomana vaZebhedhiya pabodzi novamwewo vadzidzi vairi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Pita adoti kwavari, “Ndaakuenda koraura.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Vadoti kwaari, “Tichaenda naiwewe.” Vadobirika ndokupinda mukamwadiya, asi havanai kubata chinhu usiku hwakarehwo. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Zuva paranga rakubirika, Jesu adomira pamhenderekedzo yogungwa, uku vadzidzi vadozivaba kuti wanga ari Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Jesu adoti kwavari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">“Shamwari dzangu, munohove chere?” Vadomupindura vachiti, “Neye.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Adoti kwavari, “Khandirai mambure kuruji rokamwadiya, kuti mubate.” Saka vadoyakhanda, ndokutotadza kuyadhonzera mukati nokuwanda kwohove.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Uye mudzidzi waidiwa naJesu adoti kuna Pita, “NdiIshe!” Simoni Pita paadonzva kuti ndiIshe, adopfeka hembe dzache, ndava wanga wadzisunhura, wandosara nozvomukati, adozvikhandira mugungwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Asi vamwe vadzidzi vadouya vari mukamwadiya, vachizvuva mambure yadozara nohove, ndava vanga vasiri kurefu nopanyika, asi panga padondoita mamita yanokwana zana. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pavadobirika vava panyika vadoona moto womarasha padotosasikiwa hove nomazingwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Uyai nodzimwe hove dzamabata popa.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Saka Simoni Pita adopinda ndokuzvuva mambure kunze, yanga yadozara nohove dzikurufutidzo, dzanga dzichitosvika zana ribodzi nomakumi mashano yanodzitatu, futi kunyange dzanga dzidowanditsa daipo mambure hayanai kukeruka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Uyai muje zvokuja zvomangwanani.” Zvino hapanai mudzidzi adotsunga kumubvunza kuti, “Ndimi yani?” Vadoziva kuti ndiIshe. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jesu adosvika ndokutora mazingwa achivapasa, nohove pakare.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Kakareka kanga kari kochitatu, Jesu achizvinangidza kuvadzidzi mumasure mokumuka kuvadopfa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naPita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pavadopedza kuja kwomangwanani, Jesu adoti kuna Simoni Pita, “Simoni, mwanakomana waJohwani, unondiditsa kukunda ava chere?” Adoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">“Inde, Ishe; munozviziva kuti ndinokudai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jesu adoti kwaari, “Posha hwai dzangu dzidiki.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kochipiri adomuti pakare, “Simoni, Mwanakomana waJohwani, unondida chere?” Adoti kwaari,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">“Inde, Ishe; munozviziva kuti ndinokudai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Adoti kwaari, “Chengeta hwai dzangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Adoti kwaari kochitatu, “Simoni, mwanakomana waJohwani, Unondida chere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pita adokaripa nazvo ndava wanga wati kwaari kochitatu, “Unondida chere?” Adoti futi kwaari, “Ishe, munoziva zvinhu zvese; munoziva kuti ndinokudai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jesu adoti kwaari, “Posha hwai dzangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ndinokunyairira zvochokwadi, pawanga uri mudiki, waizvisunga wotekaira kuenda kwawaida; asi kana wakura uchatambanudza manja yako, umwewo achakusunga wokuendesa kwausingade kuenda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Zvakarezvi adozvinyairira kunangidza rudzi roipfa yaaidzoita kuti Mwari akudziwe). Futi pazvidopera zvakarezvo adoti kwaari, “Nditevere.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Noumwe Mudzidzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21:20: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Johwani 13.25</char>
    </note> Pita adocheuka ndokuona mudzidzi waidiwa naJesu achivatevera, uye wanga adotsveyamira papfupi naye pakuja kwomauro, adodzoti, “Ishe, mbani achakupandukirai?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Pita paadomuona adoti kuna Jesu, “Ishe, komurume uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Kana kukava kuda kwangu kuti arambe aripo kusvikira ndauya, zvinochokuita chei naiwewe? Nditevere!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kunyaira kwakareku kudopamwarira kwese kwese pakati pohama kuti mudzidzi wakareyu waidzopfaba, asi Jesu haanai kumuti wanga asingadzopfa, asi, adoti, “Kana kuri kuda kwangu kuti arambe aripo kusvika ndichiuya, zvinochokuita chei naiwewe?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ndiye mudzidzi ari kupa upfakazi hwozvinhu zvakarezvi, adodzonyora pakare zvakarezvi; futi tinoziva kuti kupupura kwache mhwochokwadi.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Asi panozvimwewo zvinhu zvidowanda zvidoitiwa naJesu, dai zvese zvidonyorewa chibodzi nochibodzi, ndinofunga kuti pasi pese paikonaba kukwana mabhuku yaidzonyorewa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>